,"paragraphs":["FOOD WASTE Hotels/resorts: F&B waste."]},{"heading":"244. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Waste tracking / analytics."]},{"heading":"245. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μπορείτε να μετρήσετε food waste ανά outlet, meal period or category;»"]},{"heading":"246. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #74","paragraphs":["BREAKFAST / RESTAURANT QUEUES Guest experience issue."]},{"heading":"247. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Capacity/reservation analytics."]},{"heading":"248. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πότε δημιουργούνται τα μεγαλύτερα F&B queues και πόσο predictably μπορείτε να τα forecast from occupancy;»"]},{"heading":"249. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #75","paragraphs":["GUEST SEGMENTATION Leisure, business, family, luxury, repeat guest."]},{"heading":"250. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["CRM segmentation."]}]],["Σημεία 251–275 · DISCOVERY QUESTION",[{"heading":"251. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς διαφοροποιείτε communication and offers ανά guest segment today;»"]},{"heading":"252. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #76","paragraphs":["LOYALTY Hotel group wants: repeat guests."]},{"heading":"253. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Loyalty platform/integration."]},{"heading":"254. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο εύκολα αναγνωρίζεται returning guest across multiple properties;»"]},{"heading":"255. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #77","paragraphs":["CROSS-PROPERTY GUEST VIEW Guest stayed: Athens. Then Crete."]},{"heading":"256. Hotel in Crete:","paragraphs":["may not know history."]},{"heading":"257. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Group-wide guest profile."]},{"heading":"258. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Έχετε ενιαία guest identity σε όλο τον όμιλο ή κάθε property κρατά δικό του profile;»"]},{"heading":"259. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #78","paragraphs":["POST-STAY COMMUNICATION After checkout: review request, offer, survey."]},{"heading":"260. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Automated post-stay journey."]},{"heading":"261. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποια post-stay communications γίνονται today and how much are they personalized;»"]},{"heading":"262. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #79","paragraphs":["FEEDBACK SURVEYS Guest feedback: often too late."]},{"heading":"263. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["In-stay feedback."]},{"heading":"264. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μαθαίνετε guest dissatisfaction όσο ο guest είναι ακόμα στο hotel ή μόνο μετά το review;»"]},{"heading":"265. EXCELLENT QUESTION","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"266. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #80","paragraphs":["TOUR OPERATOR / DMC OPERATIONS Tourism company: may manage: transfers, excursions, hotels, guides."]},{"heading":"267. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Operations orchestration platform."]},{"heading":"268. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο manual είναι ο συντονισμός μεταξύ bookings, transport, guides and suppliers;»"]},{"heading":"269. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #81","paragraphs":["EXCURSION BOOKINGS Resort sells activities."]},{"heading":"270. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Activity booking platform."]},{"heading":"271. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #82","paragraphs":["TRANSFER MANAGEMENT Airport transfer: needs: guest, flight, vehicle, driver."]},{"heading":"272. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Transfer management."]},{"heading":"273. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς συνδέονται today flight changes with transfer scheduling;»"]},{"heading":"274. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #83","paragraphs":["FLIGHT DELAYS Guest arrival changes."]},{"heading":"275. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Flight data integration."]}]],["Σημεία 276–300 · ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #84",[{"heading":"276. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #84","paragraphs":["MULTI-PROPERTY OPERATIONS Central office: needs group view."]},{"heading":"277. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Group operations dashboard."]},{"heading":"278. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποιο operational KPI απαιτεί σήμερα το περισσότερο manual consolidation across hotels;»"]},{"heading":"279. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #85","paragraphs":["DIFFERENT PROCESSES PER HOTEL Hotel A: works one way. Hotel B: another."]},{"heading":"280. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Standardized workflows."]},{"heading":"281. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποιες processes θέλετε να είναι group-standard και ποιες πρέπει να παραμείνουν property-specific;»"]},{"heading":"282. DECISION MAKERS","paragraphs":["Depending project: General Manager Hotel Manager Group COO Revenue Director Rooms Division Manager Front Office Manager Housekeeping Manager CIO / IT Director Commercial Director CFO."]},{"heading":"283. GENERAL MANAGER","paragraphs":["Cares about: guest satisfaction, occupancy, revenue, operations."]},{"heading":"284. ROOMS DIVISION","paragraphs":["Cares about: front office, housekeeping, guest journey."]},{"heading":"285. REVENUE DIRECTOR","paragraphs":["Cares about: rate, occupancy, RevPAR, channel mix."]},{"heading":"286. COMMERCIAL DIRECTOR","paragraphs":["Cares about: bookings, distribution, corporate/groups."]},{"heading":"287. CIO","paragraphs":["Cares about: integrations, reliability, security, data."]},{"heading":"288. CFO","paragraphs":["Cares about: margin, labor, OTA cost, ROI."]},{"heading":"289. COO","paragraphs":["Cares about: group-wide efficiency."]},{"heading":"290. WHO TO APPROACH FIRST","paragraphs":["Guest journey / operations: GM / Rooms Division."]},{"heading":"291. Direct bookings / distribution:","paragraphs":["Commercial / E-commerce / Revenue."]},{"heading":"292. Housekeeping:","paragraphs":["Rooms Division / Housekeeping."]},{"heading":"293. Data/integration:","paragraphs":["CIO + business owner."]},{"heading":"294. Group transformation:","paragraphs":["COO/CIO."]},{"heading":"295. RESEARCH BEFORE OUTREACH","paragraphs":["Look for: New hotel openings New resort acquisition Brand expansion New booking engine PMS replacement Digital guest-experience initiatives New CIO/Commercial Director."]},{"heading":"296. TRIGGER","paragraphs":["New hotel opening."]},{"heading":"297. HYPOTHESIS","paragraphs":["More complexity in: PMS, housekeeping, guest journey, group reporting."]},{"heading":"298. OUTREACH EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["«Είδα ότι επεκτείνετε το hotel portfolio σας. Σε τέτοιες φάσεις συχνά αυξάνεται η πολυπλοκότητα σε PMS integrations, group reporting και guest operations. Δεν ξέρω αν είναι θέμα για εσάς, αλλά θα είχε νόημα να καταλάβω πώς standardizeάρετε σήμερα processes across properties;»"]},{"heading":"299. ANOTHER TRIGGER","paragraphs":["New PMS."]},{"heading":"300. POSSIBLE PAIN","paragraphs":["migration, integrations, training, data consistency."]}]],["Σημεία 301–325 · DISCOVERY OPENING",[{"heading":"301. DISCOVERY OPENING","paragraphs":["«Θα ήθελα να καταλάβω τη διαδρομή του guest από booking μέχρι checkout και πού σήμερα υπάρχει το περισσότερο manual work ή operational friction.»"]},{"heading":"302. ANOTHER OPENING","paragraphs":["«Πού χάνεται σήμερα περισσότερο information μεταξύ Reservations, Front Office, Housekeeping and Maintenance;»"]},{"heading":"303. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["«Αν η occupancy πήγαινε από 60% σε 95% αύριο, ποιο operational process θα πιεζόταν πρώτο;»"]},{"heading":"304. VERY STRONG","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"305. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["«Ποιο guest request δημιουργεί σήμερα τις περισσότερες εσωτερικές κλήσεις ή messages;»"]},{"heading":"306. METRICS TO DISCOVER","paragraphs":["Rooms Properties Occupancy ADR RevPAR Direct booking share OTA share Check-in time."]},{"heading":"307. ALSO","paragraphs":["Room turnaround time Maintenance response time Guest complaint rate Repeat guest rate Labor cost."]},{"heading":"308. BUSINESS CASE — DIRECT BOOKINGS","paragraphs":["Potential benefit: reduced commission."]},{"heading":"309. BUT","paragraphs":["must consider: marketing/acquisition cost."]},{"heading":"310. DON'T TREAT DIRECT BOOKINGS AS FREE","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"311. BUSINESS CASE — CHECK-IN","paragraphs":["Minutes saved: × arrivals: × staff time."]},{"heading":"312. BUSINESS CASE — HOUSEKEEPING","paragraphs":["Faster room readiness: may improve: early check-in / operations."]},{"heading":"313. BUSINESS CASE — MAINTENANCE","paragraphs":["Reduced out-of-order room time: can protect revenue."]},{"heading":"314. BUSINESS CASE — GUEST REQUESTS","paragraphs":["Less coordination time."]},{"heading":"315. BUSINESS CASE — GROUP REPORTING","paragraphs":["Management hours saved."]},{"heading":"316. TECHNICAL DISCOVERY","paragraphs":["Ask: PMS? Channel Manager? Booking Engine? CRM? POS? RMS? ERP/accounting? Housekeeping/maintenance tools?"]},{"heading":"317. ALSO","paragraphs":["APIs? Payment gateways? Door lock systems? BMS? Guest Wi-Fi?"]},{"heading":"318. SOURCE OF TRUTH","paragraphs":["Ask: «Ποιο system είναι master για reservation, room status, guest profile, rate and folio data;»"]},{"heading":"319. VERY IMPORTANT","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"320. INTEGRATION MAP","paragraphs":["Could be: Website ↓ Booking Engine ↓ PMS ↓ Channel Manager ↓ CRM ↓ ERP."]},{"heading":"321. DON'T BUILD WITHOUT KNOWING","paragraphs":["which system owns: which data."]},{"heading":"322. REAL-TIME NEEDS","paragraphs":["Room status: may need fast update."]},{"heading":"323. Guest profile update:","paragraphs":["maybe near-real-time."]},{"heading":"324. Monthly finance report:","paragraphs":["doesn't need same speed."]},{"heading":"325. DON'T MAKE EVERYTHING REAL-TIME","paragraphs":[]}]],["Σημεία 326–350 · API ACCESS",[{"heading":"326. API ACCESS","paragraphs":["Third-party hotel systems: may have: limitations."]},{"heading":"327. VALIDATE EARLY","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"328. LEGACY PMS","paragraphs":["May be: hard to integrate."]},{"heading":"329. TECHNICAL RISK","paragraphs":["must be explicit."]},{"heading":"330. HOTEL POC","paragraphs":["Could test: PMS integration digital check-in guest messaging housekeeping sync."]},{"heading":"331. PROTOTYPE","paragraphs":["Could test: guest journey staff workflow concierge portal."]},{"heading":"332. PILOT","paragraphs":["Could be: one property."]},{"heading":"333. VERY LOGICAL FOR GROUPS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"334. PILOT SUCCESS CRITERIA","paragraphs":["Guest adoption Staff adoption Processing time Integration reliability Guest satisfaction signal."]},{"heading":"335. DON'T PILOT WITHOUT METRICS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"336. USER EXPERIENCE","paragraphs":["Hotel guest: wants: simple."]},{"heading":"337. DON'T FORCE APP DOWNLOAD","paragraphs":["for one-night stay unless: real value."]},{"heading":"338. WEB-BASED EXPERIENCE","paragraphs":["may sometimes be better."]},{"heading":"339. STAFF UX","paragraphs":["must be: fast."]},{"heading":"340. Reception cannot:","paragraphs":["navigate complex screens: while guest waits."]},{"heading":"341. HOUSEKEEPER","paragraphs":["needs: few clicks."]},{"heading":"342. MAINTENANCE TECHNICIAN","paragraphs":["needs: mobile workflow."]},{"heading":"343. HOTEL OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Έχουμε ήδη PMS.» Response: «Τότε δεν ξεκινάμε από replacement. Θα ήθελα να δω πού υπάρχουν gaps ανάμεσα σε PMS, housekeeping, maintenance, CRM ή guest communication.»"]},{"heading":"344. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Έχουμε ήδη booking engine.» Response: «Τότε το ερώτημα είναι αν το challenge βρίσκεται στο booking flow, conversion, rate/inventory sync ή στο τι γίνεται μετά το booking.»"]},{"heading":"345. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Έχουμε ήδη app.» Response: «Τότε θα ήθελα να δω adoption και ποια guest problems λύνει πραγματικά το app σήμερα.»"]},{"heading":"346. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Οι guests δεν χρησιμοποιούν digital check-in.» Response: «Τότε χρειάζεται να δούμε γιατί — timing, UX, trust ή lack of benefit — πριν αλλάξουμε technology.»"]},{"heading":"347. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Το staff δεν θα χρησιμοποιεί άλλο system.» Response: «Σωστό αν προσθέτει βήματα. Θα είχε αξία μόνο αν αφαιρεί τηλεφωνήματα, WhatsApp και διπλή καταχώριση.»"]},{"heading":"348. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Θέλουμε AI concierge.» Response: «Πριν μιλήσουμε για AI, θα πρέπει να ορίσουμε ποια guest requests θα καλύπτει, ποια verified hotel data θα χρησιμοποιεί και ποια requests πρέπει να escalated σε άνθρωπο.»"]},{"heading":"349. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["Customer wants: hotel app without clear use case."]},{"heading":"350. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["No PMS API access."]}]],["Σημεία 351–375 · RED FLAG",[{"heading":"351. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["Group wants: one platform but properties: have completely different processes."]},{"heading":"352. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["Digital guest project: without Front Office involvement."]},{"heading":"353. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["CRM project: without privacy review."]},{"heading":"354. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["AI concierge: without verified knowledge source."]},{"heading":"355. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["Huge rollout: just before season opening."]},{"heading":"356. STAKEHOLDER MAP EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["General Manager Business Owner Rooms Division Manager Champion CIO Technical Buyer CFO Economic Buyer Procurement Paper Process."]},{"heading":"357. DIRECT BOOKING PROJECT","paragraphs":["Commercial Director Problem Owner E-commerce Manager Champion IT Technical GM/CFO Economic."]},{"heading":"358. HOUSEKEEPING PROJECT","paragraphs":["Rooms Division Business Owner Housekeeping Manager Champion IT Technical GM/COO Executive Sponsor."]},{"heading":"359. CHAMPION SIGNAL","paragraphs":["Rooms Division Manager: shares: real guest/operations data, brings: Front Office + Housekeeping + IT."]},{"heading":"360. FALSE CHAMPION","paragraphs":["Employee: likes digital tools but: cannot influence workflow."]},{"heading":"361. MULTI-THREADING","paragraphs":["Hotel project often needs: Operations Commercial/Revenue IT Finance Property Management."]},{"heading":"362. HOTEL DEMO","paragraphs":["Show: real guest journey."]},{"heading":"363. EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["Guest books ↓ pre-arrival message ↓ online check-in ↓ room ready alert ↓ guest request ↓ department task ↓ resolution ↓ post-stay feedback."]},{"heading":"364. MUCH BETTER THAN GENERIC CRM DEMO","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"365. HOUSEKEEPING DEMO","paragraphs":["Checkout ↓ room becomes dirty ↓ housekeeper assigned ↓ cleaned ↓ inspected ↓ PMS updates room ready."]},{"heading":"366. STRONG","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"367. MAINTENANCE DEMO","paragraphs":["Guest reports issue ↓ ticket created ↓ technician assigned ↓ repair completed ↓ room status updated ↓ history stored."]},{"heading":"368. HOTEL PROPOSAL","paragraphs":["Should cover: Guest journey Operational workflows Existing PMS/ecosystem Integrations Seasonality Privacy/security Rollout Training."]},{"heading":"369. NUMBER OF ROOMS MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"370. NUMBER OF PROPERTIES MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"371. NUMBER OF USERS MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"372. SEASONALITY MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"373. NUMBER OF INTEGRATIONS MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"374. PHASED ROLLOUT","paragraphs":["Example: Phase 1 Guest requests. Phase 2 Housekeeping/maintenance. Phase 3 CRM/analytics."]},{"heading":"375. OR","paragraphs":["Property 1 ↓ 3 hotels ↓ group."]}]],["Σημεία 376–400 · GO-LIVE TIMING",[{"heading":"376. GO-LIVE TIMING","paragraphs":["Critical."]},{"heading":"377. DON'T GO LIVE","paragraphs":["day before: high season."]},{"heading":"378. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πότε είναι η operationally safest period for system change;»"]},{"heading":"379. TRAINING","paragraphs":["Seasonal staff: means: training matters."]},{"heading":"380. SUPPORT","paragraphs":["Hotels: operate 24/7."]},{"heading":"381. SUPPORT MODEL","paragraphs":["must reflect: real criticality."]},{"heading":"382. HOTEL AI OPPORTUNITIES","paragraphs":["Potentially: Guest messaging Review classification Revenue forecasting support Document processing Internal staff assistant."]},{"heading":"383. AI GUEST MESSAGING","paragraphs":["Could handle: common questions."]},{"heading":"384. BUT","paragraphs":["needs: accurate hotel information."]},{"heading":"385. DON'T LET AI INVENT","paragraphs":["breakfast times, cancellation rules, transfer details."]},{"heading":"386. AI ESCALATION","paragraphs":["Human handoff: important."]},{"heading":"387. REVIEW ANALYSIS","paragraphs":["AI can categorize: themes."]},{"heading":"388. BUT","paragraphs":["don't overinterpret sentiment."]},{"heading":"389. STAFF ASSISTANT","paragraphs":["Could answer: SOP questions."]},{"heading":"390. NEED","paragraphs":["approved knowledge base."]},{"heading":"391. REVENUE AI","paragraphs":["Could support: forecasting."]},{"heading":"392. BUT","paragraphs":["don't promise: perfect pricing."]},{"heading":"393. HOTEL VALUE HYPOTHESIS EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["FACT: Hotel group added new properties. CHANGE: More operations and systems. POSSIBLE PROBLEM: Fragmented reporting and guest data. IMPACT: More manual consolidation + inconsistent experience. CAPABILITY: Group-wide integration/data layer. QUESTION: «How are you maintaining consistent operational and guest visibility as the group expands?»"]},{"heading":"394. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["FACT: Direct-booking campaign launched. POSSIBLE PROBLEM: Booking conversion / guest journey gap. QUESTION: «Which step of the direct booking journey currently creates the most drop-off or support need?»"]},{"heading":"395. FACT ≠ CONCLUSION","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"396. HOTEL SALES OPENING #1","paragraphs":["«Θα ήθελα να καταλάβω πού χάνεται σήμερα περισσότερο information μεταξύ booking, reception, housekeeping and maintenance.»"]},{"heading":"397. OPENING #2","paragraphs":["«Ποιο guest request απαιτεί σήμερα τα περισσότερα εσωτερικά τηλεφωνήματα ή WhatsApp messages μέχρι να λυθεί;»"]},{"heading":"398. OPENING #3","paragraphs":["«Αν η occupancy πήγαινε αύριο στο 95%, ποια operational διαδικασία θα πιεζόταν πρώτη;»"]},{"heading":"399. OPENING #4","paragraphs":["«Ποιο μέρος του guest journey δημιουργεί σήμερα τα περισσότερα complaints ή manual work;»"]},{"heading":"400. WHAT NOT TO SAY","paragraphs":["«Χρειάζεστε νέο PMS.»"]}]],["Σημεία 401–425 · DON'T SAY",[{"heading":"401. DON'T SAY","paragraphs":["«Χρειάζεστε app.»"]},{"heading":"402. DON'T SAY","paragraphs":["«AI concierge will replace reception.»"]},{"heading":"403. DON'T SAY","paragraphs":["«Θα αυξήσουμε direct bookings 40%.»"]},{"heading":"404. DON'T SAY","paragraphs":["«Θα αυτοματοποιήσουμε όλο το hotel.»"]},{"heading":"405. KEY HOTEL TERMS","paragraphs":["Salesperson should know: PMS CRS Channel Manager Booking Engine OTA RMS ADR RevPAR Occupancy Folio."]},{"heading":"406. CRS","paragraphs":["Central Reservation System."]},{"heading":"407. OTA","paragraphs":["Online Travel Agency. Example category: Booking platforms."]},{"heading":"408. FOLIO","paragraphs":["Guest account/bill."]},{"heading":"409. ALSO","paragraphs":["No-show Allotment Upsell Housekeeping Status Out-of-Order Room MICE."]},{"heading":"410. HOTEL DISCOVERY CARD","paragraphs":["Properties [ ] Rooms [ ] PMS [ ] Booking Engine [ ] Channel Manager [ ] CRM [ ] POS [ ] RMS [ ] Main Guest Pain [ ] Main Staff Pain [ ] Main Integration Gap [ ] Housekeeping Process [ ] Maintenance Process [ ] Direct Booking Share [ ] Business Owner [ ] Technical Owner [ ] Economic Buyer [ ]"]},{"heading":"411. QUALIFICATION","paragraphs":["Pain measurable? Guest/revenue/operational impact? Business owner? IT involved? API access? Timing outside dangerous season?"]},{"heading":"412. HOTEL OPPORTUNITY SCORE","paragraphs":["Business pain __/5 Guest/revenue impact __/5 Technical feasibility __/5 Stakeholder support __/5 Timing __/5 Strategic fit __/5 Total: /30."]},{"heading":"413. 26–30","paragraphs":["Strong opportunity."]},{"heading":"414. 20–25","paragraphs":["Good."]},{"heading":"415. 14–19","paragraphs":["Early/risky."]},{"heading":"416. Below 14","paragraphs":["Do not overinvest."]},{"heading":"417. ROLE PLAY 1","paragraphs":["General Manager: «Έχουμε πάρα πολλά guest requests.» Sales: «Ποια 3 requests είναι συχνότερα, πώς ανατίθενται σήμερα και πού χάνεται περισσότερο time μέχρι closure;»"]},{"heading":"418. ROLE PLAY 2","paragraphs":["Rooms Division Manager: «Τα rooms αργούν να γίνουν ready.» Sales: «Πού δημιουργείται το μεγαλύτερο delay — checkout notification, assignment, cleaning, inspection ή PMS update;»"]},{"heading":"419. ROLE PLAY 3","paragraphs":["Commercial Director: «Θέλω περισσότερα direct bookings.» Sales: «Ποιο μέρος του direct journey θεωρείτε σήμερα μεγαλύτερο barrier — traffic quality, booking UX, rate competitiveness, trust ή payment;»"]},{"heading":"420. ROLE PLAY 4","paragraphs":["CIO: «Έχουμε ήδη PMS και CRM.» Sales: «Τότε θα ήθελα να καταλάβω πού τα systems δεν επικοινωνούν καλά ή πού οι teams εξακολουθούν να χρησιμοποιούν manual workarounds γύρω από αυτά.»"]},{"heading":"421. ROLE PLAY 5","paragraphs":["CEO: «Τι μπορείτε να κάνετε για τον όμιλό μας;» Sales: «Θα ξεκινούσα από τέσσερα σημεία: πού η guest experience σπάει μεταξύ departments, πού το staff δουλεύει με WhatsApp/Excel επειδή systems δεν συνδέονται, πού χάνεται revenue από operational issues και πού group management δεν έχει ενιαία visibility.»"]},{"heading":"422. ROLE PLAY 6","paragraphs":["Customer: «Θέλω hotel app.» Sales: «Ποια συγκεκριμένη guest journey θέλετε να βελτιώσει το app και τι θέλετε να μπορεί να κάνει καλύτερα ο guest μετά την εγκατάστασή του;»"]},{"heading":"423. ROLE PLAY 7","paragraphs":["Customer: «Θέλουμε AI concierge.» Sales: «Θα ξεκινούσα με 10–20 συγκεκριμένα guest use cases, verified data sources και clear handoff rules προς staff, αντί να προσπαθήσουμε να κάνουμε τον assistant να απαντά τα πάντα.»"]},{"heading":"424. ROLE PLAY 8","paragraphs":["Customer: «Θέλω rollout σε όλα τα hotels πριν το καλοκαίρι.» Sales: «Αν τα properties έχουν διαφορετικά PMS/processes, θα ήθελα πρώτα να επιβεβαιώσουμε integration and adoption σε αντιπροσωπευτικό property ώστε να μη δημιουργήσουμε group-wide operational risk λίγο πριν high season.»"]},{"heading":"425. ACCOUNT EXPANSION","paragraphs":["Successful: guest-request workflow. Could expand: to: housekeeping maintenance CRM other hotels."]}]],["Σημεία 426–431 · ANOTHER",[{"heading":"426. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["Housekeeping ↓ maintenance ↓ group operations."]},{"heading":"427. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["Direct-booking optimization ↓ guest CRM ↓ loyalty."]},{"heading":"428. BUT","paragraphs":["always: new discovery + business case."]},{"heading":"429. HOTEL GOLDEN RULE","paragraphs":["«Στα ξενοδοχεία η μεγαλύτερη software ευκαιρία βρίσκεται συνήθως στα σημεία όπου η εμπειρία του guest εξαρτάται από το αν πολλά departments και systems ανταλλάσσουν σωστά και γρήγορα πληροφορία.»"]},{"heading":"430. Η ΤΕΛΙΚΗ ΡΟΗ","paragraphs":["RESEARCH HOTEL / GROUP / GROWTH ↓ IDENTIFY COMMERCIAL OR OPERATIONAL TRIGGER ↓ MAP GUEST JOURNEY ↓ MAP FRONT OFFICE / HOUSEKEEPING / MAINTENANCE FLOW ↓ FIND MANUAL HANDOFFS / GUEST FRICTION ↓ QUANTIFY REVENUE / LABOR / SERVICE IMPACT ↓ INVOLVE OPERATIONS + COMMERCIAL + IT ↓ MAP PMS / CHANNEL / CRM / POS / RMS ↓ IDENTIFY SOURCE OF TRUTH + API RISKS ↓ BUILD BUSINESS CASE ↓ PILOT ON ONE PROPERTY / PROCESS WHERE USEFUL ↓ MEASURE GUEST + STAFF + REVENUE OUTCOMES ↓ ROLL OUT CAREFULLY ↓ EXPAND RESPONSIBLY."]},{"heading":"431. Η ΜΙΑ ΦΡΑΣΗ ΠΟΥ ΠΡΕΠΕΙ ΝΑ ΘΥΜΑΤΑΙ Η ΟΜΑΔΑ","paragraphs":["«Σε Hotels & Tourism δεν ξεκινάμε ρωτώντας “θέλετε app, PMS ή chatbot;”. Ξεκινάμε από το πού περιμένει ο guest, πού ένα request χάνεται μεταξύ departments, πού ένα δωμάτιο αργεί να γίνει διαθέσιμο, πού χάνεται revenue και πού τα systems δεν δίνουν στο προσωπικό τη σωστή πληροφορία τη σωστή στιγμή.» Αυτό είναι: DISTILLOGIC HOTELS & TOURISM PLAYBOOK."]}]],["Πριν απαντήσεις στο quiz",["Ξανασκέψου το εισαγωγικό περιστατικό. Ποιο γεγονός είναι επιβεβαιωμένο, ποια πληροφορία λείπει και ποια ενέργεια θα μείωνε την αβεβαιότητα; Μία απάντηση μπορεί να ακούγεται εμπορικά ελκυστική αλλά να προηγείται της απαιτούμενης επιβεβαίωσης.","Οι δύο ερωτήσεις εφαρμογής γενικών αρχών συνδέονται και με τις προαιρετικές «Γενικές σημειώσεις». Το PDF βρίσκεται μόνιμα στο μενού, δεν αποτελεί ξεχωριστό υποχρεωτικό μάθημα και η ανάγνωσή του δεν βαθμολογείται.","Η επάνοδος χρειάζεται λόγο, συνάφεια και σεβασμό ορίων. Γενικές σημειώσεις: follow-up.","Μια ερμηνεία δεν είναι ακόμη τεκμηριωμένη αιτία. Γενικές σημειώσεις: learning orientation και ανασκόπηση."]]],"scenario":["Ξενοδοχειακός όμιλος έχει PMS και channel manager αλλά ασυμφωνίες μεταξύ κρατήσεων, housekeeping και οικονομικών αναφορών.","Χαρτογράφηση της διαδρομής κράτησης και των αλλαγών κατάστασης μεταξύ συστημάτων/ομάδων. Το συγκεκριμένο λειτουργικό κενό προηγείται της επιλογής προϊόντος."],"minutes":41,"version":1,"additional_curriculum":37,"question_rows":[["Ξενοδοχειακός όμιλος έχει PMS και channel manager αλλά ασυμφωνίες μεταξύ κρατήσεων, housekeeping και οικονομικών αναφορών. Ποια προσέγγιση είναι πιο τεκμηριωμένη;","Χαρτογράφηση της διαδρομής κράτησης και των αλλαγών κατάστασης μεταξύ συστημάτων/ομάδων.","Νέο booking engine πριν ελεγχθεί η υφιστάμενη λειτουργία.","Αντικατάσταση του PMS επειδή υπάρχει channel manager.","Μόνο νέο website για να είναι συνεπής η εικόνα του ομίλου.","Το συγκεκριμένο λειτουργικό κενό προηγείται της επιλογής προϊόντος."],["Ξενοδοχειακός όμιλος έχει PMS και channel manager αλλά ασυμφωνίες μεταξύ κρατήσεων, housekeeping και οικονομικών αναφορών. Τι ρωτάς για μια ασυμφωνία διαθεσιμότητας;","Ποια πηγή είναι υπεύθυνη και πότε ενημερώνονται τα υπόλοιπα κανάλια μετά από αλλαγή κράτησης.","Ποιο κανάλι είχε τις περισσότερες εμφανίσεις τον προηγούμενο μήνα.","Ποιο δωμάτιο έχει τις καλύτερες φωτογραφίες.","Ποια αναφορά προτιμά ο διευθυντής ως προς τη γραμματοσειρά.","Η πηγή και ο χρόνος ενημέρωσης εξηγούν τη σύγκρουση καταστάσεων."],["Ξενοδοχειακός όμιλος έχει PMS και channel manager αλλά ασυμφωνίες μεταξύ κρατήσεων, housekeeping και οικονομικών αναφορών. Πώς επιλέγεται λογική πιλοτική εφαρμογή;","Μία σαφής διαδρομή σε ξενοδοχείο με αντιπροσωπευτικές βάρδιες, integrations και κριτήρια χρήσης.","Ταυτόχρονα όλα τα ξενοδοχεία στην πιο φορτωμένη ημέρα.","Μόνο demo στη διοίκηση χωρίς προσωπικό λειτουργίας.","Μόνο μέτρηση επισκεψιμότητας του website.","Ο πιλότος εξετάζει πραγματική λειτουργία, όχι μόνο παρουσίαση."],["Ο πελάτης δεν απαντά μετά από αίτημα προσφοράς. Έχεις νέο στοιχείο σχετικό με την ανάγκη και δεν υπάρχει αίτημα διακοπής. Ποιο follow-up έχει μεγαλύτερη αξία;","Σύντομη σύνδεση με την προηγούμενη συζήτηση, νέο χρήσιμο στοιχείο και εύκολη πρόταση επόμενου βήματος μέσω επιτρεπόμενου καναλιού.","Το ίδιο «είδατε την προσφορά;» κάθε ημέρα σε όλα τα κανάλια.","Αυτόματη δήλωση αποδοχής αν δεν υπάρξει απάντηση.","Αποστολή νέας έκπτωσης πριν διευκρινιστεί ο λόγος σιωπής.","Η επάνοδος χρειάζεται λόγο, συνάφεια και σεβασμό ορίων. Γενικές σημειώσεις: follow-up."],["Σε ανασκόπηση χαμένης ευκαιρίας ο πωλητής λέει «μας κέρδισε η τιμή». Ποιο επόμενο βήμα παράγει μάθηση;","Ελέγχουμε στοιχεία και feedback για κριτήρια απόφασης, ανταγωνισμό, αδράνεια και στάδια που δεν επιβεβαιώθηκαν.","Καταγράφουμε αυτόματα ανταγωνιστή ως αιτία χωρίς στοιχεία.","Μειώνουμε οριζόντια όλες τις μελλοντικές τιμές.","Διαγράφουμε την ευκαιρία ώστε να μη μειώσει το ποσοστό επιτυχίας.","Μια ερμηνεία δεν είναι ακόμη τεκμηριωμένη αιτία. Γενικές σημειώσεις: learning orientation και ανασκόπηση."]],"source_note":"Πηγή: ΜΑΘΗΜΑ 31.docx, κεφάλαιο 39. Διατηρείται το κείμενο των αριθμημένων σημείων, με ενοποίηση των σπασμένων γραμμών και αφαίρεση επαναλαμβανόμενης μορφοποίησης. Τα παραδείγματα δεν αλλάζουν τους κανόνες της εφαρμογής."},"di-enterprise-40":{"pillar":"distillogic","title":"40. Ακίνητα και διαχείριση εγκαταστάσεων","goal":"Να αναγνωρίζεις πραγματικές ανάγκες, να διερευνάς τα στοιχεία και να επιλέγεις υπεύθυνο επόμενο βήμα.","sections":[["Από την έννοια στην επαγγελματική πράξη",["Property manager λαμβάνει αιτήματα μισθωτών μέσω email και τηλεφώνου, χωρίς κοινή εικόνα ανά ακίνητο ή τεκμηρίωση ολοκλήρωσης.","Στη μελέτη που ακολουθεί σύνδεσε κάθε πιθανή λύση με συγκεκριμένη διαδικασία, υπεύθυνο, επίπτωση και στοιχεία που μπορούν να επαληθευτούν. Η τεχνική δυνατότητα, η οικονομική αξία και η εξουσιοδότηση για απόφαση είναι διαφορετικά ερωτήματα. Τα παραδείγματα του κεφαλαίου σε βοηθούν να τα διερευνάς χωρίς να υπόσχεσαι κάτι που δεν έχει εγκριθεί.","Η ύλη περιγράφει ενδεικτικές επιχειρηματικές ανάγκες και μεθόδους πώλησης. Δεν αποτελεί κατάλογο έτοιμων λειτουργιών των δύο CRM, δεσμευτική προσφορά, αλλαγή αμοιβών ή νέα πολιτική πιστοποίησης. Για πραγματική εργασία ισχύουν οι εγκεκριμένοι εταιρικοί όροι και οι αρμοδιότητες. Το μάθημα 60 είναι προετοιμασία, όχι δεύτερη επίσημη τελική εξέταση."]],["Το αντικείμενο του κεφαλαίου",["ΑΚΙΝΗΤΑ & ΔΙΑΧΕΙΡΙΣΗ ΑΚΙΝΗΤΩΝ Πώς πουλάμε software και technology services σε εταιρείες real estate, property managers, developers και facility operators"]],["Σημεία 1–25 · Η ΒΑΣΙΚΗ ΑΡΧΗ",[{"heading":"1. Η ΒΑΣΙΚΗ ΑΡΧΗ","paragraphs":["Στο real estate: δεν πουλάμε: «ένα CRM για ακίνητα». Πουλάμε: ΚΑΛΥΤΕΡΟ ΕΛΕΓΧΟ ΧΑΡΤΟΦΥΛΑΚΙΟΥ, ΜΙΣΘΩΣΕΩΝ, TENANTS, ΣΥΝΤΗΡΗΣΗΣ, ΕΙΣΠΡΑΞΕΩΝ ΚΑΙ ΑΠΟΔΟΣΗΣ ΑΚΙΝΗΤΩΝ."]},{"heading":"2. ΤΙ ΕΙΝΑΙ REAL ESTATE CUSTOMER","paragraphs":["Μπορεί να είναι: Property Management Company Real Estate Developer REIC / Investment Company Commercial Property Owner Residential Portfolio Owner Facility Management Company Mall / Retail Property Operator Office Building Operator Logistics Property Owner."]},{"heading":"3. Ο ΚΛΑΔΟΣ ΕΧΕΙ ΠΟΛΛΕΣ ΔΙΑΦΟΡΕΤΙΚΕΣ ΡΟΕΣ","paragraphs":["Property acquisition ↓ Lease ↓ Tenant onboarding ↓ Operations ↓ Maintenance ↓ Billing ↓ Renewal ↓ Exit / re-leasing."]},{"heading":"4. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #1","paragraphs":["PROPERTY PORTFOLIO VISIBILITY Management θέλει να ξέρει: Πόσα ακίνητα; Ποια είναι occupied; Ποια είναι vacant; Ποια έχουν issues; Τι αποδίδουν;"]},{"heading":"5. PROBLEM","paragraphs":["Information may live in: ERP, Excel, property system, emails."]},{"heading":"6. SOFTWARE OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Portfolio dashboard Asset data platform Property management integration."]},{"heading":"7. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσα διαφορετικά systems ή reports χρειάζεται management για να αποκτήσει πλήρη εικόνα του property portfolio;»"]},{"heading":"8. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #2","paragraphs":["PROPERTY MASTER DATA Each property needs: address, area, unit, owner, tenant, contract, documents."]},{"heading":"9. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Central property master."]},{"heading":"10. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πού βρίσκεται σήμερα η authoritative καρτέλα κάθε property/unit;»"]},{"heading":"11. SOURCE OF TRUTH","paragraphs":["Πολύ σημαντικό."]},{"heading":"12. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #3","paragraphs":["VACANCY Empty unit: means: lost income."]},{"heading":"13. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Vacancy tracking + leasing pipeline."]},{"heading":"14. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μπορείτε να δείτε άμεσα vacancy ανά building, unit type και period;»"]},{"heading":"15. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #4","paragraphs":["LEASING PIPELINE Potential tenant: inquiry ↓ viewing ↓ proposal ↓ negotiation ↓ lease."]},{"heading":"16. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Leasing CRM."]},{"heading":"17. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς παρακολουθείτε σήμερα από initial inquiry μέχρι signed lease;»"]},{"heading":"18. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #5","paragraphs":["LEAD LOSS Inquiry arrives: email/phone. Nobody follows up."]},{"heading":"19. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Lead capture + follow-up automation."]},{"heading":"20. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς ξέρετε ότι κάθε property inquiry έχει owner και next action;»"]},{"heading":"21. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #6","paragraphs":["UNIT MATCHING Tenant needs: specific location/size/budget."]},{"heading":"22. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Property matching/search tool."]},{"heading":"23. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο manual είναι σήμερα το matching μεταξύ tenant requirements και διαθέσιμων units;»"]},{"heading":"24. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #7","paragraphs":["VIEWINGS Need: schedule: property visits."]},{"heading":"25. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Viewing scheduling workflow."]}]],["Σημεία 26–50 · DISCOVERY QUESTION",[{"heading":"26. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς προγραμματίζονται και καταγράφονται σήμερα property viewings και follow-ups;»"]},{"heading":"27. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #8","paragraphs":["LEASE MANAGEMENT Every lease has: start date, end date, rent, deposit, escalation, options."]},{"heading":"28. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Lease management system."]},{"heading":"29. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς παρακολουθείτε critical lease dates και commercial terms σήμερα;»"]},{"heading":"30. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #9","paragraphs":["LEASE EXPIRY Lease expires. Nobody acts early."]},{"heading":"31. RESULT","paragraphs":["Renewal opportunity: lost."]},{"heading":"32. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Renewal alerts."]},{"heading":"33. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο νωρίς πριν από expiry ξεκινά σήμερα renewal process και πώς γίνεται το alert;»"]},{"heading":"34. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #10","paragraphs":["RENT ESCALATION Contracts may include: annual rent increases."]},{"heading":"35. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Automated rent escalation workflow."]},{"heading":"36. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς εξασφαλίζετε ότι rent escalation εφαρμόζεται σωστά και στην ώρα του;»"]},{"heading":"37. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #11","paragraphs":["RENT COLLECTION Tenant must pay: monthly."]},{"heading":"38. PROBLEM","paragraphs":["Late payments. Manual reconciliation."]},{"heading":"39. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Billing + payment + ERP integration."]},{"heading":"40. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο manual είναι το reconciliation μεταξύ invoicing, bank/payment data και outstanding tenant balances;»"]},{"heading":"41. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #12","paragraphs":["ARREARS Late tenant payments."]},{"heading":"42. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Arrears dashboard / reminder workflow."]},{"heading":"43. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μπορείτε να δείτε εύκολα arrears aging ανά tenant/property;»"]},{"heading":"44. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #13","paragraphs":["DEPOSIT MANAGEMENT Security deposits: need proper tracking."]},{"heading":"45. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Deposit ledger / contract workflow."]},{"heading":"46. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #14","paragraphs":["TENANT ONBOARDING New tenant: needs: lease, deposit, access, utilities, contact details."]},{"heading":"47. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Tenant onboarding workflow."]},{"heading":"48. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσα departments εμπλέκονται από signed lease μέχρι tenant move-in;»"]},{"heading":"49. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #15","paragraphs":["TENANT PORTAL Tenant needs: invoices, requests, documents, announcements."]},{"heading":"50. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Tenant self-service portal."]}]],["Σημεία 51–75 · DISCOVERY QUESTION",[{"heading":"51. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποια αιτήματα tenants στέλνονται σήμερα κυρίως με email ή τηλέφωνο;»"]},{"heading":"52. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #16","paragraphs":["MAINTENANCE REQUESTS Tenant reports: leak, HVAC, lighting, access issue."]},{"heading":"53. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Maintenance ticketing."]},{"heading":"54. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς καταγράφεται σήμερα ένα maintenance request και πώς ξέρει ο tenant πότε ολοκληρώθηκε;»"]},{"heading":"55. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #17","paragraphs":["NO REQUEST OWNERSHIP Email sent. Nobody knows: who owns it."]},{"heading":"56. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Ticket ownership + SLA."]},{"heading":"57. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Κάθε maintenance request έχει ξεκάθαρο owner, priority και due date;»"]},{"heading":"58. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #18","paragraphs":["MAINTENANCE HISTORY Same equipment: fails repeatedly."]},{"heading":"59. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Asset maintenance history."]},{"heading":"60. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μπορείτε να δείτε recurring faults ανά building, unit ή asset;»"]},{"heading":"61. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #19","paragraphs":["PREVENTIVE MAINTENANCE Buildings contain: HVAC, elevators, pumps, fire systems."]},{"heading":"62. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["CMMS / preventive maintenance."]},{"heading":"63. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς προγραμματίζετε recurring maintenance και inspections σε όλα τα properties;»"]},{"heading":"64. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #20","paragraphs":["CONTRACTOR MANAGEMENT External contractors: handle repairs."]},{"heading":"65. NEED","paragraphs":["track: assignment, quote, attendance, completion, invoice."]},{"heading":"66. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Contractor management portal."]},{"heading":"67. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς παρακολουθείτε contractor performance, response time και cost σήμερα;»"]},{"heading":"68. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #21","paragraphs":["QUOTE APPROVAL Repair requires: quotation."]},{"heading":"69. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Digital approval workflow."]},{"heading":"70. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο χρόνο χάνεται από contractor quote μέχρι approval;»"]},{"heading":"71. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #22","paragraphs":["SERVICE LEVELS Commercial tenants: may have service commitments."]},{"heading":"72. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["SLA tracking."]},{"heading":"73. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μπορείτε να δείτε response and resolution performance ανά building/contractor;»"]},{"heading":"74. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #23","paragraphs":["FACILITY INSPECTIONS Buildings need: regular inspections."]},{"heading":"75. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Digital inspection app."]}]],["Σημεία 76–100 · DISCOVERY QUESTION",[{"heading":"76. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποια building inspections καταγράφονται ακόμα σε paper or Excel;»"]},{"heading":"77. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #24","paragraphs":["FIRE / SAFETY CHECKS Critical recurring tasks."]},{"heading":"78. SOFTWARE CAN SUPPORT","paragraphs":["scheduling, evidence, corrective actions."]},{"heading":"79. DON'T CLAIM","paragraphs":["software itself: ensures compliance."]},{"heading":"80. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #25","paragraphs":["CORRECTIVE ACTIONS Inspection finds: problem. Who fixes it?"]},{"heading":"81. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Finding → action → closure workflow."]},{"heading":"82. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς παρακολουθείτε findings από inspection μέχρι final closure;»"]},{"heading":"83. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #26","paragraphs":["PROPERTY DOCUMENTS Each property has: title docs, plans, permits, contracts, certificates."]},{"heading":"84. PROBLEM","paragraphs":["Files scattered."]},{"heading":"85. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Property document repository."]},{"heading":"86. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο γρήγορα μπορείτε να βρείτε το latest approved document για συγκεκριμένο property;»"]},{"heading":"87. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #27","paragraphs":["DOCUMENT EXPIRY Some certificates: expire."]},{"heading":"88. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Document expiry alerts."]},{"heading":"89. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς παρακολουθείτε documents/certificates με expiry dates across the portfolio;»"]},{"heading":"90. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #28","paragraphs":["LEASE DOCUMENT VERSION CONTROL Draft 1. Draft 5. Signed copy."]},{"heading":"91. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Controlled contract repository."]},{"heading":"92. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Υπάρχει ένα σημείο όπου όλοι βλέπουν το final signed lease και τα latest amendments;»"]},{"heading":"93. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #29","paragraphs":["OWNER REPORTING Property manager: reports to owner/investor."]},{"heading":"94. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Automated owner reporting."]},{"heading":"95. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο χρόνο χρειάζεται κάθε μήνα για owner reporting ανά property;»"]},{"heading":"96. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #30","paragraphs":["PORTFOLIO KPI REPORTING Need: occupancy, rent, arrears, maintenance, costs."]},{"heading":"97. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Portfolio BI."]},{"heading":"98. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποια KPI απαιτούν σήμερα manual consolidation;»"]},{"heading":"99. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #31","paragraphs":["NOI VISIBILITY NOI: Net Operating Income."]},{"heading":"100. SALESPERSON SHOULD RECOGNIZE TERM","paragraphs":[]}]],["Σημεία 101–125 · SIMPLE",[{"heading":"101. SIMPLE","paragraphs":["Property income minus: operating expenses."]},{"heading":"102. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο εύκολα βλέπετε NOI ανά asset and portfolio in current reporting;»"]},{"heading":"103. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #32","paragraphs":["OCCUPANCY Basic real-estate metric."]},{"heading":"104. NEED","paragraphs":["know: leased vs vacant space."]},{"heading":"105. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #33","paragraphs":["RENT ROLL Key lease/rent summary."]},{"heading":"106. SALESPERSON SHOULD RECOGNIZE","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"107. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο automated είναι η παραγωγή rent roll και πόσο συχνά χρειάζεται manual correction;»"]},{"heading":"108. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #34","paragraphs":["CAPEX PLANNING Buildings need: major investments."]},{"heading":"109. EXAMPLES","paragraphs":["Roof, HVAC, elevator, renovation."]},{"heading":"110. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Capex planning dashboard."]},{"heading":"111. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς ιεραρχείτε capital projects across properties and how do you track planned vs actual spend;»"]},{"heading":"112. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #35","paragraphs":["OPEX CONTROL Operating expenses: may vary widely."]},{"heading":"113. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Opex analytics."]},{"heading":"114. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μπορείτε να συγκρίνετε operating cost ανά sqm/building και να εντοπίσετε abnormal variance;»"]},{"heading":"115. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #36","paragraphs":["SERVICE CHARGE Commercial properties: may allocate common costs."]},{"heading":"116. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Service-charge calculation workflow."]},{"heading":"117. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο manual είναι το allocation common operating costs across tenants;»"]},{"heading":"118. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #37","paragraphs":["UTILITY BILLING Water, electricity, heating."]},{"heading":"119. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Metering/billing integration."]},{"heading":"120. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο automated είναι η μεταφορά meter data σε tenant billing;»"]},{"heading":"121. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #38","paragraphs":["ENERGY CONSUMPTION Buildings: large energy users."]},{"heading":"122. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Energy analytics."]},{"heading":"123. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μπορείτε να συγκρίνετε energy consumption ανά sqm, tenant or building;»"]},{"heading":"124. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #39","paragraphs":["WATER / LEAK MONITORING Leak: creates: cost/damage."]},{"heading":"125. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Monitoring + alerts."]}]],["Σημεία 126–150 · DISCOVERY QUESTION",[{"heading":"126. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς εντοπίζετε abnormal water consumption or leak today;»"]},{"heading":"127. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #40","paragraphs":["BMS DATA Building Management System."]},{"heading":"128. BMS MAY CONTROL","paragraphs":["HVAC, energy, lighting."]},{"heading":"129. SOFTWARE OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Often: analytics/integration, not replacement."]},{"heading":"130. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Το BMS data χρησιμοποιείται σήμερα μόνο από technical team ή συνδέεται και με cost/occupancy reporting;»"]},{"heading":"131. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #41","paragraphs":["ACCESS CONTROL Tenants, visitors, contractors."]},{"heading":"132. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Access workflow integration."]},{"heading":"133. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο manual είναι το provisioning and removal of building access for tenants/contractors;»"]},{"heading":"134. SECURITY CRITICAL","paragraphs":["Physical access: must be treated: carefully."]},{"heading":"135. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #42","paragraphs":["VISITOR MANAGEMENT Office/commercial buildings: many visitors."]},{"heading":"136. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Visitor management."]},{"heading":"137. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς γίνεται σήμερα visitor pre-registration, arrival and host notification;»"]},{"heading":"138. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #43","paragraphs":["CONTRACTOR ACCESS Technician arrives. Needs: approval/access."]},{"heading":"139. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Contractor access workflow."]},{"heading":"140. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #44","paragraphs":["MOVE-IN / MOVE-OUT Tenant transition: involves: inspection, keys, meters, deposit, access."]},{"heading":"141. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Move workflow."]},{"heading":"142. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο structured είναι σήμερα move-in/move-out process and who confirms completion;»"]},{"heading":"143. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #45","paragraphs":["CONDITION REPORTS Unit before tenant. After tenant."]},{"heading":"144. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Photo inspection app."]},{"heading":"145. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς τεκμηριώνετε property condition at handover and return;»"]},{"heading":"146. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #46","paragraphs":["DEFECT MANAGEMENT New development: has defects/snags."]},{"heading":"147. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Defect / snagging platform."]},{"heading":"148. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς παρακολουθείτε defects από inspection μέχρι contractor closure;»"]},{"heading":"149. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #47","paragraphs":["CONSTRUCTION HANDOVER Developer delivers: property to owner/operator."]},{"heading":"150. NEED","paragraphs":["Transfer: drawings, warranties, asset registers, manuals."]}]],["Σημεία 151–175 · OPPORTUNITY",[{"heading":"151. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Digital handover platform."]},{"heading":"152. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς παραδίδεται σήμερα asset/document information από construction team στο property/facility team;»"]},{"heading":"153. VERY STRONG","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"154. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #48","paragraphs":["ASSET REGISTER Building equipment: needs structured list."]},{"heading":"155. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Digital asset register."]},{"heading":"156. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Υπάρχει complete asset register with model, serial, warranty and maintenance history;»"]},{"heading":"157. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #49","paragraphs":["WARRANTY TRACKING New equipment: under warranty."]},{"heading":"158. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Warranty alert/workflow."]},{"heading":"159. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο συχνά πληρώνεται repair που ίσως θα έπρεπε να καλύπτεται από warranty;»"]},{"heading":"160. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #50","paragraphs":["DEVELOPMENT SALES CRM Real estate developer: sells units."]},{"heading":"161. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Property sales CRM."]},{"heading":"162. FLOW","paragraphs":["Lead ↓ Viewing ↓ Reservation ↓ Deposit ↓ Contract ↓ Handover."]},{"heading":"163. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς παρακολουθείτε buyer journey από enquiry μέχρι final handover;»"]},{"heading":"164. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #51","paragraphs":["UNIT INVENTORY Developer must know: available, reserved, sold."]},{"heading":"165. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Real-time unit availability."]},{"heading":"166. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μπορεί Sales να δει live ποια units είναι available, reserved or sold;»"]},{"heading":"167. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #52","paragraphs":["PRICE LIST CONTROL Different unit: different price."]},{"heading":"168. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Central pricing."]},{"heading":"169. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς ελέγχετε approved price list versions and discounts across brokers/salespeople;»"]},{"heading":"170. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #53","paragraphs":["BROKER / AGENT MANAGEMENT External brokers: bring leads."]},{"heading":"171. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Broker portal / commission tracking."]},{"heading":"172. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς αποφεύγετε duplicate leads and commission disputes between agents;»"]},{"heading":"173. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #54","paragraphs":["PROPERTY MARKETING DATA Website, portals, brokers."]},{"heading":"174. Need consistent:","paragraphs":["photos, specs, price, availability."]},{"heading":"175. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Property feed / content integration."]}]],["Σημεία 176–200 · DISCOVERY QUESTION",[{"heading":"176. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο manual είναι το updating property availability and price across marketing channels;»"]},{"heading":"177. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #55","paragraphs":["LEAD SOURCE ATTRIBUTION Which campaign: brings: qualified buyers?"]},{"heading":"178. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["CRM analytics."]},{"heading":"179. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μπορείτε να συνδέσετε lead source μέχρι signed lease or sale;»"]},{"heading":"180. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #56","paragraphs":["PROPERTY ACQUISITION PIPELINE Investment company: evaluates assets."]},{"heading":"181. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Acquisition pipeline/workflow."]},{"heading":"182. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς παρακολουθείτε properties from initial opportunity through due diligence and investment decision;»"]},{"heading":"183. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #57","paragraphs":["DUE DILIGENCE Many documents: legal, technical, financial."]},{"heading":"184. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Due diligence workspace."]},{"heading":"185. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο fragmented είναι σήμερα το due diligence process across legal, technical and finance teams;»"]},{"heading":"186. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #58","paragraphs":["INVESTMENT COMMITTEE MATERIAL Need: consistent investment analysis."]},{"heading":"187. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Investment memo/data workflow."]},{"heading":"188. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #59","paragraphs":["VALUATION DATA Need: rent, occupancy, capex, market assumptions."]},{"heading":"189. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Valuation data integration."]},{"heading":"190. IMPORTANT","paragraphs":["Software supports: valuation. Doesn't replace: qualified professional judgment."]},{"heading":"191. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #60","paragraphs":["PORTFOLIO PERFORMANCE Investors want: asset-level performance."]},{"heading":"192. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Portfolio analytics."]},{"heading":"193. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μπορείτε να compare assets consistently by income, occupancy, cost and capital spend;»"]},{"heading":"194. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #61","paragraphs":["BUDGET VS ACTUAL Property budget: vs actual."]},{"heading":"195. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Financial dashboard."]},{"heading":"196. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο real-time είναι η εικόνα budget vs actual by property;»"]},{"heading":"197. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #62","paragraphs":["RENT FORECAST Future income: depends on: leases."]},{"heading":"198. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Lease-based revenue forecasting."]},{"heading":"199. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο εύκολα μπορείτε να forecast rent revenue taking into account expiries, vacancies and escalations;»"]},{"heading":"200. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #63","paragraphs":["TENANT RETENTION Keeping good tenant: may matter."]}]],["Σημεία 201–225 · OPPORTUNITY",[{"heading":"201. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Tenant relationship/satisfaction analytics."]},{"heading":"202. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς γνωρίζετε αρκετά νωρίς ότι tenant relationship is at risk before renewal;»"]},{"heading":"203. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #64","paragraphs":["TENANT SATISFACTION Requests unresolved: affect relationship."]},{"heading":"204. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Service feedback."]},{"heading":"205. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μπορείτε να συνδέσετε tenant satisfaction with maintenance/service response;»"]},{"heading":"206. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #65","paragraphs":["MULTI-PROPERTY OPERATIONS Different buildings: different teams/processes."]},{"heading":"207. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Standardized group workflows."]},{"heading":"208. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποιες operating processes θέλετε να είναι standardized across properties and which need local flexibility;»"]},{"heading":"209. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #66","paragraphs":["PROPERTY MANAGER REPORTING Site managers: send spreadsheets."]},{"heading":"210. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Centralized reporting."]},{"heading":"211. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποιο recurring property report απαιτεί σήμερα περισσότερο manual effort;»"]},{"heading":"212. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #67","paragraphs":["MOBILE FIELD INSPECTIONS Property teams: move between buildings."]},{"heading":"213. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Mobile inspection/maintenance app."]},{"heading":"214. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο από το field work καταγράφεται αργότερα στο office επειδή δεν υπάρχει mobile workflow;»"]},{"heading":"215. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #68","paragraphs":["OFFLINE REQUIREMENTS Basements, plant rooms: may have weak connectivity."]},{"heading":"216. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Offline-capable mobile app."]},{"heading":"217. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #69","paragraphs":["SMART BUILDING DATA Sensors: produce: occupancy, temperature, energy data."]},{"heading":"218. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Smart-building analytics."]},{"heading":"219. DON'T SELL","paragraphs":["IoT: because trendy."]},{"heading":"220. ASK","paragraphs":["«Ποια operating decision would improve if this building data were actually available in one place;»"]},{"heading":"221. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #70","paragraphs":["OCCUPANCY SENSORS Could support: space utilization."]},{"heading":"222. PRIVACY IMPORTANT","paragraphs":["Avoid unnecessary: individual tracking."]},{"heading":"223. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #71","paragraphs":["SPACE UTILIZATION Office owner: may want know: which spaces are used."]},{"heading":"224. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Space analytics."]},{"heading":"225. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποια space decisions σήμερα βασίζονται περισσότερο σε assumption than actual utilization data;»"]}]],["Σημεία 226–250 · ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #72",[{"heading":"226. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #72","paragraphs":["FLEXIBLE OFFICE / COWORKING Need: desk booking, rooms, access, billing."]},{"heading":"227. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Workspace platform."]},{"heading":"228. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο integrated είναι booking, access, billing and tenant profile in the flexible-space operation;»"]},{"heading":"229. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #73","paragraphs":["MEETING ROOM MANAGEMENT Commercial offices: book rooms."]},{"heading":"230. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Room booking integration."]},{"heading":"231. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #74","paragraphs":["PARKING MANAGEMENT Parking spaces: allocated/paid."]},{"heading":"232. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Parking management."]},{"heading":"233. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο manual είναι parking allocation and visitor parking today;»"]},{"heading":"234. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #75","paragraphs":["MALL / RETAIL PROPERTY Mall manager needs: tenant sales, traffic, rent, service charges."]},{"heading":"235. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Mall management analytics."]},{"heading":"236. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μπορείτε να combine tenant sales, footfall, occupancy and rent data for better leasing decisions;»"]},{"heading":"237. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #76","paragraphs":["LOGISTICS PROPERTIES Warehouse owner: needs: tenant, maintenance, utilities, service levels."]},{"heading":"238. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Industrial property management."]},{"heading":"239. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #77","paragraphs":["HOTEL REAL ESTATE Owner/operator distinction."]},{"heading":"240. Need separate:","paragraphs":["asset performance from: hotel operations."]},{"heading":"241. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Owner reporting."]},{"heading":"242. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #78","paragraphs":["ESG / SUSTAINABILITY DATA Real-estate groups: may track: energy, water, emissions-related data."]},{"heading":"243. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Data consolidation/reporting."]},{"heading":"244. IMPORTANT","paragraphs":["Do not claim: compliance conclusions without specialists."]},{"heading":"245. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποια sustainability data απαιτούν σήμερα το περισσότερο manual collection across properties;»"]},{"heading":"246. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #79","paragraphs":["DATA QUALITY Area, rent, tenant, asset information: may differ: across files."]},{"heading":"247. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Master-data governance."]},{"heading":"248. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποια property data είναι πιο δύσκολο να εμπιστευτείτε σήμερα because different systems show different values;»"]},{"heading":"249. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #80","paragraphs":["DUPLICATE DATA ENTRY Lease data: entered: property system + ERP + CRM."]},{"heading":"250. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["System integration."]}]],["Σημεία 251–275 · DISCOVERY QUESTION",[{"heading":"251. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποια lease/property data ξαναγράφονται σε περισσότερα από ένα systems;»"]},{"heading":"252. DECISION MAKERS","paragraphs":["Depending project: Head of Property Management Asset Manager Facility Manager Leasing Director Development Director CIO / IT Director CFO COO Investment Director."]},{"heading":"253. PROPERTY MANAGER","paragraphs":["Cares about: tenants, maintenance, operations, rent."]},{"heading":"254. ASSET MANAGER","paragraphs":["Cares about: asset performance, value, occupancy, NOI."]},{"heading":"255. FACILITY MANAGER","paragraphs":["Cares about: maintenance, contractors, inspections, building systems."]},{"heading":"256. LEASING DIRECTOR","paragraphs":["Cares about: vacancy, pipeline, renewals, occupancy."]},{"heading":"257. CIO","paragraphs":["Cares about: integrations, architecture, security, data."]},{"heading":"258. CFO","paragraphs":["Cares about: rent, arrears, cost, NOI, ROI."]},{"heading":"259. COO","paragraphs":["Cares about: portfolio operations."]},{"heading":"260. INVESTMENT DIRECTOR","paragraphs":["Cares about: acquisition, performance, valuation, exit."]},{"heading":"261. WHO TO APPROACH FIRST","paragraphs":["Maintenance/tenant service: Property or Facility Manager."]},{"heading":"262. Leasing:","paragraphs":["Leasing Director."]},{"heading":"263. Portfolio analytics:","paragraphs":["Asset Management."]},{"heading":"264. Systems/data:","paragraphs":["CIO + business owner."]},{"heading":"265. Major transformation:","paragraphs":["COO/CIO."]},{"heading":"266. RESEARCH BEFORE OUTREACH","paragraphs":["Look for: Portfolio growth New development New property acquisition New mall/office opening New property-management mandate Digital tenant portal initiative."]},{"heading":"267. TRIGGER","paragraphs":["Acquisition of large property portfolio."]},{"heading":"268. HYPOTHESIS","paragraphs":["More assets: may increase: reporting/maintenance/lease complexity."]},{"heading":"269. OUTREACH EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["«Είδα ότι το property portfolio σας έχει επεκταθεί. Σε τέτοιες φάσεις συχνά αυξάνεται η πολυπλοκότητα σε lease tracking, maintenance και consolidated reporting. Δεν γνωρίζω αν ισχύει σε εσάς, αλλά θα είχε νόημα να καταλάβω πώς ενοποιείτε σήμερα property data across assets;»"]},{"heading":"270. ANOTHER TRIGGER","paragraphs":["New mixed-use development."]},{"heading":"271. POSSIBLE PAINS","paragraphs":["tenant onboarding, access, facilities, billing."]},{"heading":"272. DISCOVERY OPENING","paragraphs":["«Θα ήθελα να καταλάβω τη διαδρομή από signed lease μέχρι tenant operation και πού σήμερα υπάρχει το περισσότερο manual coordination.»"]},{"heading":"273. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["«Πού χάνεται σήμερα η περισσότερη πληροφορία μεταξύ tenant, property team, contractor και finance;»"]},{"heading":"274. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["«Αν το portfolio διπλασιαζόταν αύριο, ποια property-management process δεν θα μπορούσε να συνεχίσει όπως σήμερα;»"]},{"heading":"275. STRONG SCALE QUESTION","paragraphs":[]}]],["Σημεία 276–300 · METRICS TO DISCOVER",[{"heading":"276. METRICS TO DISCOVER","paragraphs":["Properties Units Occupancy Vacancy Rent collection Arrears Maintenance requests Resolution time."]},{"heading":"277. ALSO","paragraphs":["NOI Opex Capex Renewal rate Tenant satisfaction Contractor SLA."]},{"heading":"278. BUSINESS CASE — VACANCY","paragraphs":["Empty unit: lost rental income."]},{"heading":"279. BUT","paragraphs":["software doesn't automatically: fill vacancy. It can support: leasing process."]},{"heading":"280. BUSINESS CASE — MAINTENANCE","paragraphs":["Faster resolution: can reduce: tenant disruption, potential damage, admin time."]},{"heading":"281. BUSINESS CASE — RENT COLLECTION","paragraphs":["Less manual reconciliation."]},{"heading":"282. BUSINESS CASE — REPORTING","paragraphs":["Reduced management/admin hours."]},{"heading":"283. BUSINESS CASE — ENERGY","paragraphs":["Potential savings: only with validated data."]},{"heading":"284. TECHNICAL DISCOVERY","paragraphs":["Ask: Property Management System? ERP/accounting? CRM? CMMS? BMS? Access system? Payment systems?"]},{"heading":"285. ALSO","paragraphs":["APIs? Tenant portal? Document system? BI/data warehouse?"]},{"heading":"286. SOURCE OF TRUTH","paragraphs":["Ask: «Ποιο system είναι master για property, unit, tenant, lease, invoice and maintenance data;»"]},{"heading":"287. CRITICAL","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"288. PROPERTY DATA HIERARCHY","paragraphs":["Portfolio ↓ Property ↓ Building ↓ Floor ↓ Unit ↓ Asset. Depending customer."]},{"heading":"289. GOOD DATA MODEL","paragraphs":["matters."]},{"heading":"290. REAL-TIME NEEDS","paragraphs":["Access/maintenance alerts: may need fast updates."]},{"heading":"291. Monthly owner report:","paragraphs":["not real-time."]},{"heading":"292. DON'T MAKE EVERYTHING REAL-TIME","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"293. BMS / OT SECURITY","paragraphs":["Building systems: may be operationally sensitive."]},{"heading":"294. NEVER CONNECT DIRECTLY","paragraphs":["without: technical/security validation."]},{"heading":"295. THIRD-PARTY SYSTEMS","paragraphs":["May restrict: API access."]},{"heading":"296. VALIDATE EARLY","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"297. REAL ESTATE POC","paragraphs":["Could test: BMS integration lease data extraction tenant portal owner dashboard."]},{"heading":"298. PROTOTYPE","paragraphs":["Could test: tenant request flow leasing CRM inspection app."]},{"heading":"299. PILOT","paragraphs":["Could be: one building."]},{"heading":"300. VERY LOGICAL","paragraphs":["for: property groups."]}]],["Σημεία 301–325 · PILOT SUCCESS CRITERIA",[{"heading":"301. PILOT SUCCESS CRITERIA","paragraphs":["Adoption Request resolution visibility Data accuracy Reduced reporting time."]},{"heading":"302. PROPERTY MANAGEMENT OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Έχουμε ήδη property management software.» Response: «Τότε δεν θα ξεκινούσα από replacement. Θα ήθελα να δω πού υπάρχουν gaps, duplicate entry ή manual workflows γύρω από το υπάρχον system.»"]},{"heading":"303. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Τα maintenance requests τα χειριζόμαστε με email.» Response: «Αν το email σας δίνει owner, priority, response tracking και history χωρίς problem, ίσως δεν χρειάζεται αλλαγή. Πού ακριβώς χάνεται visibility σήμερα;»"]},{"heading":"304. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Οι tenants δεν θα χρησιμοποιήσουν portal.» Response: «Τότε πρέπει να καταλάβουμε τι πραγματική αξία θα τους δίνει. Αν είναι απλώς άλλο login, adoption πιθανότατα θα είναι χαμηλό.»"]},{"heading":"305. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Θέλουμε smart building.» Response: «Ποιο συγκεκριμένο operational, energy or tenant outcome θέλετε να αλλάξει; Από αυτό πρέπει να ξεκινήσει η technology choice.»"]},{"heading":"306. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Θέλουμε AI για leases.» Response: «Μπορούμε να εξετάσουμε document extraction or summarization, αλλά πρέπει να ορίσουμε ποια fields/clauses θέλουμε να εντοπίζονται και πού απαιτείται legal review από άνθρωπο.»"]},{"heading":"307. VERY IMPORTANT","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"308. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["No reliable property master data."]},{"heading":"309. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["Multiple lease versions: no controlled repository."]},{"heading":"310. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["Tenant portal: without tenant research."]},{"heading":"311. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["BMS integration: without facilities/IT/security."]},{"heading":"312. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["Portfolio dashboard: but source data poor."]},{"heading":"313. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["AI lease project: expected to replace lawyers."]},{"heading":"314. STAKEHOLDER MAP EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["Head of Property Management Business Owner Facility Manager Champion CIO Technical Buyer CFO Economic Buyer Procurement Paper Process."]},{"heading":"315. LEASING PROJECT","paragraphs":["Leasing Director Problem Owner Leasing Manager Champion IT Technical COO/CFO Economic."]},{"heading":"316. ASSET-MANAGEMENT PROJECT","paragraphs":["Asset Director Business Owner Portfolio Manager Champion IT/Data Technical Investment Committee/CFO Economic."]},{"heading":"317. CHAMPION SIGNAL","paragraphs":["Facility Manager: shares real request history, brings: Property + IT + Finance."]},{"heading":"318. FALSE CHAMPION","paragraphs":["Employee: likes tenant app but: doesn't own process."]},{"heading":"319. MULTI-THREADING","paragraphs":["Real-estate enterprise project often needs: Property / Asset Facility Finance IT Leasing."]},{"heading":"320. REAL ESTATE DEMO","paragraphs":["Show: real tenant journey."]},{"heading":"321. EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["Tenant reports leak ↓ Ticket created ↓ Priority assigned ↓ Contractor dispatched ↓ Photo/evidence uploaded ↓ Tenant notified ↓ Cost posted ↓ History updated."]},{"heading":"322. STRONG","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"323. LEASING DEMO","paragraphs":["Inquiry ↓ Lead qualified ↓ Unit matched ↓ Viewing ↓ Proposal ↓ Lease ↓ Tenant onboarding."]},{"heading":"324. OWNER REPORTING DEMO","paragraphs":["Property data ↓ Rent/occupancy ↓ Maintenance/opex ↓ NOI ↓ Owner dashboard."]},{"heading":"325. REAL ESTATE PROPOSAL","paragraphs":["Should cover: Portfolio scope Properties/units Tenant journey Lease workflows Maintenance Existing systems Integrations Security/privacy Rollout."]}]],["Σημεία 326–350 · NUMBER OF PROPERTIES MATTERS",[{"heading":"326. NUMBER OF PROPERTIES MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"327. NUMBER OF UNITS MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"328. NUMBER OF TENANTS MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"329. NUMBER OF BUILDING SYSTEMS MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"330. LEASE COMPLEXITY MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"331. PHASED ROLLOUT","paragraphs":["Example: Phase 1 Maintenance requests. Phase 2 Tenant portal. Phase 3 Owner reporting."]},{"heading":"332. OR","paragraphs":["Building 1 ↓ Portfolio."]},{"heading":"333. REAL ESTATE AI OPPORTUNITIES","paragraphs":["Potentially: Lease extraction Document classification Maintenance request classification Tenant assistant Portfolio analytics support."]},{"heading":"334. AI LEASE EXTRACTION","paragraphs":["Can help identify: dates, rent, options, obligations."]},{"heading":"335. BUT","paragraphs":["legal review: may still be necessary."]},{"heading":"336. DON'T CLAIM","paragraphs":["«AI will interpret every lease correctly.»"]},{"heading":"337. DOCUMENT CLASSIFICATION","paragraphs":["Good potential: large property document archives."]},{"heading":"338. MAINTENANCE AI","paragraphs":["Could categorize: tenant requests."]},{"heading":"339. TENANT ASSISTANT","paragraphs":["Could answer: common building questions."]},{"heading":"340. NEED","paragraphs":["approved knowledge base."]},{"heading":"341. REAL ESTATE VALUE HYPOTHESIS EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["FACT: Portfolio expanded. CHANGE: More assets/tenants. POSSIBLE PROBLEM: Manual lease and maintenance coordination becomes harder. IMPACT: More admin + lower visibility. CAPABILITY: Integrated property workflow. QUESTION: «How are you maintaining consistent lease, tenant and maintenance visibility as the portfolio expands?»"]},{"heading":"342. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["FACT: New office complex opening. POSSIBLE PROBLEM: Tenant onboarding/access/facility complexity. QUESTION: «How are you planning to coordinate tenant onboarding, access and facility requests when the new property becomes operational?»"]},{"heading":"343. FACT ≠ CONCLUSION","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"344. REAL ESTATE SALES OPENING #1","paragraphs":["«Θα ήθελα να καταλάβω πού υπάρχει σήμερα το περισσότερο manual coordination μεταξύ tenant, property team, contractors and finance.»"]},{"heading":"345. OPENING #2","paragraphs":["«Αν ένας tenant κάνει maintenance request σήμερα, πόσο εύκολα μπορείτε να δείτε owner, status, response time και total history;»"]},{"heading":"346. OPENING #3","paragraphs":["«Αν το portfolio διπλασιαζόταν, ποιο operational process θα δυσκολευόταν πρώτο να scale;»"]},{"heading":"347. OPENING #4","paragraphs":["«Ποιο property or lease report απαιτεί σήμερα το περισσότερο manual consolidation;»"]},{"heading":"348. WHAT NOT TO SAY","paragraphs":["«Χρειάζεστε νέο property software.»"]},{"heading":"349. DON'T SAY","paragraphs":["«Θα κάνουμε το κτίριο smart.»"]},{"heading":"350. DON'T SAY","paragraphs":["«AI θα διαβάζει όλα τα συμβόλαια χωρίς λάθος.»"]}]],["Σημεία 351–375 · DON'T SAY",[{"heading":"351. DON'T SAY","paragraphs":["«Θα αυτοματοποιήσουμε όλους τους tenants.»"]},{"heading":"352. DON'T SAY","paragraphs":["«Το Excel δεν κάνει.»"]},{"heading":"353. KEY REAL ESTATE TERMS","paragraphs":["Salesperson should know: Lease Tenant Occupancy Vacancy Rent Roll NOI Opex Capex Facility Management CMMS."]},{"heading":"354. ALSO","paragraphs":["BMS Arrears Service Charge Asset Register Renewal Handover Snagging."]},{"heading":"355. REAL ESTATE DISCOVERY CARD","paragraphs":["Properties [ ] Units [ ] Occupancy [ ] Property Management System [ ] ERP [ ] CRM [ ] CMMS [ ] BMS [ ] Main Tenant Process [ ] Maintenance Process [ ] Lease Process [ ] Reporting Process [ ] Main Integration Gap [ ] Business Owner [ ] Technical Owner [ ] Economic Buyer [ ]"]},{"heading":"356. QUALIFICATION","paragraphs":["Pain measurable? Tenant/financial impact? Process owner? IT/facilities involved? Data accessible? Timing/budget real?"]},{"heading":"357. REAL ESTATE OPPORTUNITY SCORE","paragraphs":["Business pain __/5 Financial/tenant impact __/5 Data/technical feasibility __/5 Stakeholder support __/5 Timing __/5 Strategic fit __/5 Total: /30."]},{"heading":"358. 26–30","paragraphs":["Strong."]},{"heading":"359. 20–25","paragraphs":["Good."]},{"heading":"360. 14–19","paragraphs":["Early/risky."]},{"heading":"361. Below 14","paragraphs":["Do not overinvest."]},{"heading":"362. ROLE PLAY 1","paragraphs":["Property Manager: «Τα maintenance requests έρχονται παντού.» Sales: «Από ποια channels έρχονται, πού καταγράφονται και πώς γνωρίζετε αν κάθε request έχει owner and deadline;»"]},{"heading":"363. ROLE PLAY 2","paragraphs":["Asset Manager: «Θέλω καλύτερο reporting.» Sales: «Ποια decision δυσκολεύεστε να πάρετε σήμερα επειδή property, lease, cost or occupancy data δεν είναι συγκεντρωμένα;»"]},{"heading":"364. ROLE PLAY 3","paragraphs":["CFO: «Δεν εμπιστεύομαι πάντα τα property numbers.» Sales: «Ποια data δημιουργούν τις περισσότερες διαφορές μεταξύ systems — rent, occupancy, opex, service charges ή lease terms;»"]},{"heading":"365. ROLE PLAY 4","paragraphs":["CIO: «Έχουμε ήδη property management platform.» Sales: «Τότε θα ήθελα να δω τι καλύπτει καλά και πού παραμένουν duplicate entry, manual workflows ή integration gaps γύρω της.»"]},{"heading":"366. ROLE PLAY 5","paragraphs":["CEO: «Τι μπορείτε να κάνετε για το portfolio μας;» Sales: «Θα ξεκινούσα από τέσσερα σημεία: lease and occupancy visibility, tenant service, maintenance/contractor control και το πόσο manual είναι το owner/financial reporting. Μετά θα δούμε πού υπάρχει πραγματικό business value.»"]},{"heading":"367. ROLE PLAY 6","paragraphs":["Customer: «Θέλω tenant app.» Sales: «Ποια 2–3 tenant problems θέλετε να λύνει καλύτερα από email, phone ή existing portal; Αν δεν λύνει κάτι συγκεκριμένο, το app από μόνο του δεν έχει αξία.»"]},{"heading":"368. ROLE PLAY 7","paragraphs":["Customer: «Θέλουμε AI για όλα τα leases.» Sales: «Θα ξεκινούσα με συγκεκριμένα fields and clauses που θέλετε να extractάρονται, representative lease samples και human review rules πριν μιλήσουμε για portfolio-wide automation.»"]},{"heading":"369. ROLE PLAY 8","paragraphs":["Customer: «Θέλω rollout σε όλα τα buildings.» Sales: «Αν τα properties έχουν διαφορετικά systems και processes, θα ήταν ασφαλέστερο να validate workflow and integrations σε αντιπροσωπευτικό property πριν full-portfolio rollout.»"]},{"heading":"370. ACCOUNT EXPANSION","paragraphs":["Successful: maintenance platform. Could expand: to: tenant portal contractor management inspections owner reporting."]},{"heading":"371. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["Leasing CRM ↓ tenant onboarding ↓ renewal management."]},{"heading":"372. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["One building ↓ portfolio."]},{"heading":"373. BUT","paragraphs":["always: new discovery + business case."]},{"heading":"374. REAL ESTATE GOLDEN RULE","paragraphs":["«Στο real estate η μεγαλύτερη software ευκαιρία βρίσκεται συχνά στα σημεία όπου η πληροφορία περνά μεταξύ property owner, tenant, facility team, contractor, leasing και finance και κανείς δεν έχει μία ενιαία, αξιόπιστη εικόνα του τι συμβαίνει.»"]},{"heading":"375. Η ΤΕΛΙΚΗ ΡΟΗ","paragraphs":["RESEARCH PORTFOLIO / PROPERTY TYPE / GROWTH ↓ IDENTIFY PORTFOLIO OR TENANT TRIGGER ↓ SPEAK TO PROPERTY / ASSET OWNER ↓ MAP LEASE / TENANT / MAINTENANCE FLOWS ↓ FIND MANUAL HANDOFFS / DATA GAPS ↓ QUANTIFY RENT / TIME / COST / SERVICE IMPACT ↓ INVOLVE FINANCE + IT + FACILITY ↓ MAP PROPERTY SYSTEM / ERP / CRM / CMMS / BMS ↓ IDENTIFY SOURCE OF TRUTH ↓ BUILD BUSINESS CASE ↓ PILOT ON ONE PROPERTY OR PROCESS ↓ MEASURE DATA QUALITY + SERVICE + FINANCIAL VALUE ↓ SCALE ACROSS PORTFOLIO ↓ EXPAND RESPONSIBLY."]}]],["Σημεία 376–376 · Η ΜΙΑ ΦΡΑΣΗ ΠΟΥ ΠΡΕΠΕΙ ΝΑ ΘΥΜΑΤΑΙ Η ΟΜΑΔΑ",[{"heading":"376. Η ΜΙΑ ΦΡΑΣΗ ΠΟΥ ΠΡΕΠΕΙ ΝΑ ΘΥΜΑΤΑΙ Η ΟΜΑΔΑ","paragraphs":["«Σε Real Estate & Property Management δεν ξεκινάμε ρωτώντας “θέλετε tenant app ή νέο property system;”. Ξεκινάμε από το αν ξέρετε με ακρίβεια τι συμβαίνει σε κάθε asset, ποιος tenant χρωστά ή λήγει το lease του, ποιο maintenance issue μένει ανοιχτό και πόσο χρόνο χρειάζεται management για να αποκτήσει πραγματική εικόνα του portfolio.» Αυτό είναι: DISTILLOGIC REAL ESTATE & PROPERTY MANAGEMENT PLAYBOOK."]}]],["Πριν απαντήσεις στο quiz",["Ξανασκέψου το εισαγωγικό περιστατικό. Ποιο γεγονός είναι επιβεβαιωμένο, ποια πληροφορία λείπει και ποια ενέργεια θα μείωνε την αβεβαιότητα; Μία απάντηση μπορεί να ακούγεται εμπορικά ελκυστική αλλά να προηγείται της απαιτούμενης επιβεβαίωσης.","Οι δύο ερωτήσεις εφαρμογής γενικών αρχών συνδέονται και με τις προαιρετικές «Γενικές σημειώσεις». Το PDF βρίσκεται μόνιμα στο μενού, δεν αποτελεί ξεχωριστό υποχρεωτικό μάθημα και η ανάγνωσή του δεν βαθμολογείται.","Προσαρμοστική πώληση σημαίνει καλύτερη κατανόηση, όχι διαφορετική αλήθεια. Γενικές σημειώσεις: Adaptive Selling.","Η αναγνώριση μοτίβου δεν αντικαθιστά την επιβεβαίωση της συγκεκριμένης περίπτωσης. Γενικές σημειώσεις: Active Listening."]]],"scenario":["Property manager λαμβάνει αιτήματα μισθωτών μέσω email και τηλεφώνου, χωρίς κοινή εικόνα ανά ακίνητο ή τεκμηρίωση ολοκλήρωσης.","Αίτημα, ακίνητο, ανάθεση, προτεραιότητα, εργασία και επιβεβαίωση κλεισίματος. Η ροή πρέπει να καλύπτει τον κύκλο ζωής του αιτήματος."],"minutes":37,"version":1,"additional_curriculum":37,"question_rows":[["Property manager λαμβάνει αιτήματα μισθωτών μέσω email και τηλεφώνου, χωρίς κοινή εικόνα ανά ακίνητο ή τεκμηρίωση ολοκλήρωσης. Τι πρέπει να περιγράφει το πρώτο λειτουργικό σενάριο;","Αίτημα, ακίνητο, ανάθεση, προτεραιότητα, εργασία και επιβεβαίωση κλεισίματος.","Μόνο μια φόρμα επικοινωνίας με καλύτερη εμφάνιση.","Μόνο συγκεντρωτικό οικονομικό dashboard.","Αυτόματη διαγραφή αιτημάτων όταν δεν υπάρχει απάντηση.","Η ροή πρέπει να καλύπτει τον κύκλο ζωής του αιτήματος."],["Property manager λαμβάνει αιτήματα μισθωτών μέσω email και τηλεφώνου, χωρίς κοινή εικόνα ανά ακίνητο ή τεκμηρίωση ολοκλήρωσης. Ποιο metric δείχνει πιθανή αξία;","Χρόνος από αναφορά έως ανάθεση/επίλυση και αριθμός αιτημάτων χωρίς υπεύθυνο.","Συνολική εκτιμώμενη εμπορική αξία όλων των ακινήτων.","Πλήθος φωτογραφιών ανά κτίριο.","Αριθμός εταιρικών λογοτύπων στο portal.","Η μέτρηση συνδέεται με το πρόβλημα διαχείρισης εργασιών."],["Property manager λαμβάνει αιτήματα μισθωτών μέσω email και τηλεφώνου, χωρίς κοινή εικόνα ανά ακίνητο ή τεκμηρίωση ολοκλήρωσης. Ποιος περιορισμός πρόσβασης είναι ουσιαστικός;","Ο μισθωτής βλέπει τα στοιχεία και αιτήματα που τον αφορούν, σύμφωνα με εγκεκριμένους ρόλους.","Όλοι οι μισθωτές βλέπουν όλα τα συμβόλαια για διαφάνεια.","Κοινός λογαριασμός για όλους ώστε να μειωθεί η υποστήριξη.","Πλήρης πρόσβαση συνεργείων σε οικονομικά χωρίς διάκριση.","Η λειτουργική ευκολία δεν αναιρεί τον διαχωρισμό δικαιωμάτων."],["Ο τεχνικός και ο οικονομικός υπεύθυνος θέλουν διαφορετική παρουσίαση της ίδιας πρότασης. Τι προσαρμόζεις;","Γλώσσα, βάθος και παραδείγματα στον ρόλο, κρατώντας ίδιες τις αληθείς δυνατότητες, τους όρους και τους περιορισμούς.","Τις πραγματικές δυνατότητες ώστε κάθε συνομιλητής να ακούσει αυτό που επιθυμεί.","Τους εγκεκριμένους όρους χωρίς εσωτερική έγκριση.","Την ύπαρξη τεχνικού ρίσκου μόνο στον τεχνικό, κρύβοντάς το από τον οικονομικό αγοραστή.","Προσαρμοστική πώληση σημαίνει καλύτερη κατανόηση, όχι διαφορετική αλήθεια. Γενικές σημειώσεις: Adaptive Selling."],["Σε meeting ο πελάτης περιγράφει καθυστέρηση, ενώ εσύ αναγνωρίζεις μια γνώριμη χρήση του προϊόντος. Ποια αντίδραση διατηρεί ενεργητική ακρόαση;","Συνοψίζω όσα άκουσα, ζητώ επιβεβαίωση και διερευνώ επίπτωση πριν συνδέσω τη λύση.","Διακόπτω για demo επειδή γνωρίζω ήδη την κατάλληλη λειτουργία.","Συμπληρώνω μόνος μου τα άγνωστα από προηγούμενο πελάτη.","Μεταφέρω τη συζήτηση στην τιμή πριν καταλάβω τη διαδικασία.","Η αναγνώριση μοτίβου δεν αντικαθιστά την επιβεβαίωση της συγκεκριμένης περίπτωσης. Γενικές σημειώσεις: Active Listening."]],"source_note":"Πηγή: ΜΑΘΗΜΑ 31.docx, κεφάλαιο 40. Διατηρείται το κείμενο των αριθμημένων σημείων, με ενοποίηση των σπασμένων γραμμών και αφαίρεση επαναλαμβανόμενης μορφοποίησης. Τα παραδείγματα δεν αλλάζουν τους κανόνες της εφαρμογής."},"di-enterprise-41":{"pillar":"distillogic","title":"41. Κατασκευές και τεχνικά έργα","goal":"Να αναγνωρίζεις πραγματικές ανάγκες, να διερευνάς τα στοιχεία και να επιλέγεις υπεύθυνο επόμενο βήμα.","sections":[["Από την έννοια στην επαγγελματική πράξη",["Κατασκευαστική αντιμετωπίζει εργασίες με παλιές εκδόσεις σχεδίων και αλλαγές που δεν συνδέονται καθαρά με κόστος και εγκρίσεις.","Στη μελέτη που ακολουθεί σύνδεσε κάθε πιθανή λύση με συγκεκριμένη διαδικασία, υπεύθυνο, επίπτωση και στοιχεία που μπορούν να επαληθευτούν. Η τεχνική δυνατότητα, η οικονομική αξία και η εξουσιοδότηση για απόφαση είναι διαφορετικά ερωτήματα. Τα παραδείγματα του κεφαλαίου σε βοηθούν να τα διερευνάς χωρίς να υπόσχεσαι κάτι που δεν έχει εγκριθεί.","Η ύλη περιγράφει ενδεικτικές επιχειρηματικές ανάγκες και μεθόδους πώλησης. Δεν αποτελεί κατάλογο έτοιμων λειτουργιών των δύο CRM, δεσμευτική προσφορά, αλλαγή αμοιβών ή νέα πολιτική πιστοποίησης. Για πραγματική εργασία ισχύουν οι εγκεκριμένοι εταιρικοί όροι και οι αρμοδιότητες. Το μάθημα 60 είναι προετοιμασία, όχι δεύτερη επίσημη τελική εξέταση."]],["Το αντικείμενο του κεφαλαίου",["Πώς πουλάμε software και technology services σε κατασκευαστικές, τεχνικές εταιρείες, developers, EPC contractors και project organizations"]],["Σημεία 1–25 · Η ΒΑΣΙΚΗ ΑΡΧΗ",[{"heading":"1. Η ΒΑΣΙΚΗ ΑΡΧΗ","paragraphs":["Στις κατασκευές: δεν πουλάμε: «project management software». Πουλάμε: ΚΑΛΥΤΕΡΟ ΕΛΕΓΧΟ ΕΡΓΟΥ, ΚΟΣΤΟΥΣ, ΧΡΟΝΟΥ, ΥΠΕΡΓΟΛΑΒΩΝ, ΕΓΓΡΑΦΩΝ, ΠΡΟΟΔΟΥ ΚΑΙ ΑΛΛΑΓΩΝ."]},{"heading":"2. ΤΙ ΕΙΝΑΙ CONSTRUCTION CUSTOMER","paragraphs":["Μπορεί να είναι: General Contractor EPC Contractor Developer Engineering Company Infrastructure Contractor MEP Contractor Fit-out Company Construction Group Project Management Company."]},{"heading":"3. Η ΒΑΣΙΚΗ ΡΟΗ","paragraphs":["Tender / Contract ↓ Planning ↓ Procurement ↓ Site Execution ↓ Inspection ↓ Progress ↓ Change / Variation ↓ Completion ↓ Handover."]},{"heading":"4. ΤΟ ΜΕΓΑΛΟ ΠΡΟΒΛΗΜΑ","paragraphs":["Ένα construction project έχει: πολλούς ανθρώπους, πολλούς contractors, πολλά documents, πολλές αλλαγές, πολλά deadlines."]},{"heading":"5. SOFTWARE OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["συνήθως εμφανίζεται: όταν: SITE + OFFICE + SUPPLIERS + SUBCONTRACTORS ΔΕΝ ΕΧΟΥΝ ΤΗΝ ΙΔΙΑ ΠΛΗΡΟΦΟΡΙΑ."]},{"heading":"6. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #1","paragraphs":["PROJECT VISIBILITY Management θέλει να ξέρει: Πού βρίσκεται το έργο; Τι έχει ολοκληρωθεί; Τι καθυστερεί; Τι κοστίζει περισσότερο;"]},{"heading":"7. PROBLEM","paragraphs":["Information may come from: Excel, email, site reports, ERP, scheduling tools."]},{"heading":"8. SOFTWARE OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Project controls dashboard Data integration Progress reporting."]},{"heading":"9. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσα διαφορετικά reports ή systems χρειάζεται management για να καταλάβει πραγματικά πού βρίσκεται ένα project;»"]},{"heading":"10. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #2","paragraphs":["SITE REPORTING Site engineer: records: manpower, work completed, delays, issues."]},{"heading":"11. PROBLEM","paragraphs":["Daily report: may be written manually."]},{"heading":"12. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Digital site diary."]},{"heading":"13. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς δημιουργείται σήμερα το daily site report και πόσο χρόνο παίρνει;»"]},{"heading":"14. FOLLOW-UP","paragraphs":["«Τι από αυτά τα δεδομένα ξαναγράφεται μετά σε Excel ή άλλο system;»"]},{"heading":"15. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #3","paragraphs":["PROGRESS TRACKING Need to know: what %: is complete."]},{"heading":"16. PROBLEM","paragraphs":["Progress can be: subjective."]},{"heading":"17. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Structured progress measurement."]},{"heading":"18. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς επιβεβαιώνεται σήμερα ότι ένα work package είναι πραγματικά 60% complete και όχι απλώς estimated;»"]},{"heading":"19. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #4","paragraphs":["PROGRAM / SCHEDULE Construction depends on: sequence."]},{"heading":"20. Delay in one activity:","paragraphs":["affects others."]},{"heading":"21. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Schedule integration / delay visibility."]},{"heading":"22. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο γρήγορα βλέπει η ομάδα ότι μία καθυστέρηση σε activity επηρεάζει downstream tasks;»"]},{"heading":"23. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #5","paragraphs":["LOOKAHEAD PLANNING Site team: needs: next 2–6 weeks planning."]},{"heading":"24. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Lookahead workflow."]},{"heading":"25. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς μετατρέπεται το master schedule σε πραγματικό εβδομαδιαίο plan για το site;»"]}]],["Σημεία 26–50 · ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #6",[{"heading":"26. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #6","paragraphs":["DELAYS Delay can come from: materials, subcontractor, design, weather, approvals."]},{"heading":"27. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Delay classification / analytics."]},{"heading":"28. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Μπορείτε να κατηγοριοποιήσετε delay reasons και να δείτε ποια causes επαναλαμβάνονται περισσότερο;»"]},{"heading":"29. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #7","paragraphs":["BLOCKERS Work planned. But: cannot start."]},{"heading":"30. POSSIBLE REASONS","paragraphs":["drawing missing, material missing, access issue, approval pending."]},{"heading":"31. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Constraint/blocker management."]},{"heading":"32. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσες planned activities δεν ξεκινούν στην ώρα τους επειδή κάποιο prerequisite λείπει;»"]},{"heading":"33. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #8","paragraphs":["RFI Request for Information."]},{"heading":"34. RFI USED WHEN","paragraphs":["contractor needs: clarification."]},{"heading":"35. PROBLEM","paragraphs":["RFI remains: unanswered."]},{"heading":"36. RESULT","paragraphs":["Site waits."]},{"heading":"37. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["RFI workflow."]},{"heading":"38. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσος είναι ο average response time για RFIs και ποια work packages επηρεάζονται όταν απάντηση καθυστερεί;»"]},{"heading":"39. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #9","paragraphs":["RFI STATUS VISIBILITY Need know: open, answered, overdue."]},{"heading":"40. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["RFI dashboard."]},{"heading":"41. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #10","paragraphs":["SUBMITTALS Materials/methods/drawings: may need approval."]},{"heading":"42. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Submittal workflow."]},{"heading":"43. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο εύκολο είναι να δείτε ποια submittals είναι pending and which activities depend on them;»"]},{"heading":"44. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #11","paragraphs":["DRAWING CONTROL Construction drawings: change."]},{"heading":"45. RISK","paragraphs":["Site uses: old drawing."]},{"heading":"46. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Drawing/document control."]},{"heading":"47. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς διασφαλίζετε ότι το site χρησιμοποιεί μόνο την latest approved drawing revision;»"]},{"heading":"48. VERY STRONG QUESTION","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"49. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #12","paragraphs":["VERSION CONTROL Drawing Rev A. Rev B. Rev C."]},{"heading":"50. WRONG VERSION","paragraphs":["can cause: rework."]}]],["Σημεία 51–75 · OPPORTUNITY",[{"heading":"51. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Controlled document management."]},{"heading":"52. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #13","paragraphs":["DOCUMENT DISTRIBUTION Need: know: who received: which version."]},{"heading":"53. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs