"]},{"heading":"344. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Group sustainability-data platform."]},{"heading":"345. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Which sustainability or energy metric is hardest to collect consistently from all entities;»"]},{"heading":"346. IMPORTANT","paragraphs":["Do not claim: legal compliance."]},{"heading":"347. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #97","paragraphs":["MULTI-COUNTRY OPERATIONS Different: language, currency, tax, law, process."]},{"heading":"348. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Configurable global platform."]},{"heading":"349. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Which process must be globally standardized and which elements need country-specific configuration;»"]},{"heading":"350. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #98","paragraphs":["LOCAL REGULATORY DIFFERENCES Group system: cannot assume: same rules everywhere."]}]],["Σημεία 351–375 · OPPORTUNITY",[{"heading":"351. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Configuration by entity/country."]},{"heading":"352. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #99","paragraphs":["MULTI-CURRENCY Financial/reporting complexity."]},{"heading":"353. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Financial data integration."]},{"heading":"354. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #100","paragraphs":["MULTI-LANGUAGE Employees: need: local language."]},{"heading":"355. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Multilingual enterprise UX/content."]},{"heading":"356. DECISION MAKERS","paragraphs":["Depending project: Group CEO Group COO Group CIO Group CFO Chief Data Officer Group Procurement Director Group HR Director Group Risk / Compliance Business Unit CEOs Transformation Director Enterprise Architecture Lead."]},{"heading":"357. GROUP CEO","paragraphs":["Cares about: strategic control, performance, growth, synergies."]},{"heading":"358. GROUP COO","paragraphs":["Cares about: standardization, shared services, operational efficiency."]},{"heading":"359. GROUP CIO","paragraphs":["Cares about: architecture, applications, integration, cyber, vendor landscape."]},{"heading":"360. GROUP CFO","paragraphs":["Cares about: consolidation, cash, planning, profitability, controls."]},{"heading":"361. CDO","paragraphs":["Cares about: governance, quality, data products, analytics."]},{"heading":"362. PROCUREMENT","paragraphs":["Cares about: spend, suppliers, contracts, scale."]},{"heading":"363. GROUP HR","paragraphs":["Cares about: people, skills, mobility, common processes."]},{"heading":"364. BUSINESS UNIT CEO","paragraphs":["Cares about: local business performance."]},{"heading":"365. IMPORTANT","paragraphs":["Group function: may want: standardization."]},{"heading":"366. Business unit:","paragraphs":["may resist: because: local operation works."]},{"heading":"367. SALES MUST UNDERSTAND BOTH","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"368. WHO TO APPROACH FIRST","paragraphs":["Group reporting/data: CFO/CDO/CIO."]},{"heading":"369. Shared services:","paragraphs":["COO."]},{"heading":"370. Application/integration:","paragraphs":["CIO/Enterprise Architecture."]},{"heading":"371. Procurement:","paragraphs":["Group Procurement."]},{"heading":"372. M&A integration:","paragraphs":["CIO + COO + CFO."]},{"heading":"373. Group AI:","paragraphs":["CIO/CDO/Transformation + Security/Legal."]},{"heading":"374. Enterprise-wide transformation:","paragraphs":["CEO/COO/CIO/CFO."]},{"heading":"375. RESEARCH BEFORE OUTREACH","paragraphs":["Look for: Acquisition Merger New subsidiary Geographic expansion Shared-services initiative ERP transformation Group digital transformation Data-platform program New CIO/CDO/COO."]}]],["Σημεία 376–400 · TRIGGER",[{"heading":"376. TRIGGER","paragraphs":["Recent acquisition."]},{"heading":"377. HYPOTHESIS","paragraphs":["New group company: creates: system/data/reporting fragmentation."]},{"heading":"378. OUTREACH EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["«Είδα ότι ο όμιλος πρόσθεσε νέα εταιρεία στο portfolio. Σε τέτοιες φάσεις συχνά το challenge δεν είναι απλώς system integration αλλά το πώς finance, customer, supplier and access data become visible at group level without disrupting the acquired company. Δεν γνωρίζω αν είναι priority για εσάς, αλλά θα είχε νόημα να καταλάβω ποιο integration area is hardest today;»"]},{"heading":"379. ANOTHER TRIGGER","paragraphs":["Shared-services transformation."]},{"heading":"380. HYPOTHESIS","paragraphs":["Large internal request volume."]},{"heading":"381. DISCOVERY OPENING","paragraphs":["«Θα ήθελα να χαρτογραφήσουμε ποια processes πρέπει πραγματικά να λειτουργούν group-wide και πού σήμερα οι subsidiaries χρησιμοποιούν διαφορετικά systems or workflows.»"]},{"heading":"382. VERY STRONG","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"383. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["«Which group report still requires the most Excel, email and manual reconciliation before management trusts it;»"]},{"heading":"384. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["«Which process is centrally governed but locally executed and creates the most friction today;»"]},{"heading":"385. EXCELLENT QUESTION","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"386. SCALE QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Αν ο όμιλος αποκτούσε άλλες 5 εταιρείες μέσα σε δύο χρόνια, ποιο central process would struggle first to absorb them;»"]},{"heading":"387. METRICS TO DISCOVER","paragraphs":["Number of subsidiaries Countries ERP systems CRM systems Applications Legal entities Employees Suppliers."]},{"heading":"388. ALSO","paragraphs":["Internal requests Reporting hours Intercompany reconciliations Vendor spend Group projects Data-quality issues."]},{"heading":"389. BUSINESS CASE — REPORTING","paragraphs":["Reduce: manual consolidation."]},{"heading":"390. BUSINESS CASE — PROCUREMENT","paragraphs":["Visibility: could support: group negotiation."]},{"heading":"391. BUSINESS CASE — MDM","paragraphs":["Reduce: duplicate/customer/supplier reconciliation."]},{"heading":"392. BUSINESS CASE — SHARED SERVICES","paragraphs":["Reduce: internal request handling effort."]},{"heading":"393. BUSINESS CASE — APPLICATION RATIONALIZATION","paragraphs":["Potential: license/support savings."]},{"heading":"394. BUSINESS CASE — M&A INTEGRATION","paragraphs":["Faster: group visibility/onboarding."]},{"heading":"395. BUSINESS CASE — DATA PLATFORM","paragraphs":["Faster: cross-company decision-making."]},{"heading":"396. DON'T INVENT GROUP SYNERGIES","paragraphs":["Use: customer data."]},{"heading":"397. TECHNICAL DISCOVERY","paragraphs":["Ask: How many ERP systems? CRM systems? HR systems? Identity platforms? Data platforms? Integration platforms? BI tools?"]},{"heading":"398. ALSO","paragraphs":["API management? Cloud providers? On-prem systems? Group directory? MDM? Data catalog?"]},{"heading":"399. SOURCE OF TRUTH","paragraphs":["There may be: no single source."]},{"heading":"400. Better ask:","paragraphs":["«Which system is authoritative for each major group data domain: customer, supplier, employee, entity and finance?»"]}]],["Σημεία 401–425 · VERY IMPORTANT",[{"heading":"401. VERY IMPORTANT","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"402. DON'T FORCE","paragraphs":["one database: for everything."]},{"heading":"403. FEDERATED ARCHITECTURE","paragraphs":["May be better."]},{"heading":"404. Means:","paragraphs":["local systems remain, group layer integrates: selected data/processes."]},{"heading":"405. SALESPERSON DOESN'T NEED","paragraphs":["architecture depth. But must understand: CENTRALIZATION ≠ ALWAYS REPLACEMENT."]},{"heading":"406. REAL-TIME NEEDS","paragraphs":["Security incident: fast."]},{"heading":"407. Board reporting:","paragraphs":["not necessarily."]},{"heading":"408. Supplier master:","paragraphs":["may need regular sync."]},{"heading":"409. DON'T MAKE EVERYTHING REAL-TIME","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"410. GROUP SECURITY","paragraphs":["Any enterprise integration: must consider: cross-entity access."]},{"heading":"411. IMPORTANT QUESTIONS","paragraphs":["Who can see: what? Which entity owns: data? Can parent company: access?"]},{"heading":"412. CORPORATE GROUP POC","paragraphs":["Could test: Group reporting Supplier master Customer 360 Shared-service portal Knowledge assistant."]},{"heading":"413. PROTOTYPE","paragraphs":["Could test: Group approval workflow Internal service request flow M&A onboarding dashboard."]},{"heading":"414. PILOT","paragraphs":["Could be: 2–3 subsidiaries."]},{"heading":"415. BETTER THAN","paragraphs":["all subsidiaries: from day 1."]},{"heading":"416. PILOT SUCCESS CRITERIA","paragraphs":["Data consistency Process adoption Reduced manual reconciliation Faster reporting Local acceptance."]},{"heading":"417. VERY IMPORTANT","paragraphs":["Local acceptance: is a metric."]},{"heading":"418. GROUP PROJECT CAN FAIL","paragraphs":["technically successful but: subsidiaries refuse it."]},{"heading":"419. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Κάθε εταιρεία μας είναι διαφορετική.» Response: «Τότε δεν πρέπει να standardizeάρουμε everything. Θα πρέπει να ξεχωρίσουμε ποια group controls and data definitions need consistency and where local process differences are legitimate.»"]},{"heading":"420. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Δεν θέλουμε να αλλάξουμε όλα τα ERP.» Response: «Δεν χρειάζεται απαραίτητα. Μπορούμε πρώτα να δούμε αν integration and common data layer create enough value while current ERP systems remain in place.»"]},{"heading":"421. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Οι θυγατρικές αντιδρούν στα central systems.» Response: «Then adoption is a design requirement. We need to understand which local workflows a central solution must respect and which duplicate work it must remove.»"]},{"heading":"422. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Θέλουμε ένα dashboard για όλα.» Response: «Πρώτα πρέπει να συμφωνήσουμε common definitions, trusted sources and data ownership. Ένα dashboard πάνω σε inconsistent data απλώς εμφανίζει πιο όμορφα την ασυνέπεια.»"]},{"heading":"423. VERY IMPORTANT","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"424. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Θέλουμε AI για όλο τον όμιλο.» Response: «Θα ξεκινούσα από use-case portfolio, access boundaries, approved data and entity-specific permissions πριν από οποιοδήποτε group-wide assistant.»"]},{"heading":"425. OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Θέλουμε μία πλατφόρμα για όλες τις εταιρείες.» Response: «Πρέπει πρώτα να δούμε ποια processes πραγματικά benefit from one platform and ποια require local specialization. One platform is an architecture choice, not a business objective.»"]}]],["Σημεία 426–450 · RED FLAG",[{"heading":"426. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["Group wants: standardization without: subsidiary involvement."]},{"heading":"427. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["No clear data ownership."]},{"heading":"428. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["Group dashboard: with poor source data."]},{"heading":"429. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["M&A integration: without business-process mapping."]},{"heading":"430. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["One-system-for-everything mentality."]},{"heading":"431. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["AI assistant: without permission model."]},{"heading":"432. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["Group CIO supports: but business-unit CEOs reject."]},{"heading":"433. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["Local units support: but Group Security/Finance doesn't."]},{"heading":"434. RED FLAG","paragraphs":["No sponsor: with authority across entities."]},{"heading":"435. STAKEHOLDER MAP EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["Group COO Business Owner Transformation Director Champion Group CIO Technical Buyer Group CFO Economic Buyer Business Unit CEOs Adoption Stakeholders Procurement Paper Process."]},{"heading":"436. GROUP DATA PROJECT","paragraphs":["CDO Business Owner Data Governance Lead Champion CIO/Data Engineering Technical CFO/Business Units Consumers."]},{"heading":"437. SHARED SERVICES PROJECT","paragraphs":["Group COO Business Owner Shared Services Director Champion CIO Technical CFO Economic Subsidiaries Users."]},{"heading":"438. M&A INTEGRATION PROJECT","paragraphs":["Integration Director / COO Business Owner PMO Champion CIO Technical CFO/HR/Security Key Stakeholders."]},{"heading":"439. CHAMPION SIGNAL","paragraphs":["Transformation Director: can: bring: CIO, CFO, business-unit leaders, data owners."]},{"heading":"440. FALSE CHAMPION","paragraphs":["Central employee: loves standardization but: has no influence over subsidiaries."]},{"heading":"441. MULTI-THREADING","paragraphs":["Group enterprise sale often needs: Group Function CIO/Data CFO Procurement Security Business Units Local champions."]},{"heading":"442. GROUP DEMO","paragraphs":["Show: cross-company reality."]},{"heading":"443. EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["Customer exists: in 3 subsidiaries ↓ records matched ↓ group relationship visible ↓ account owner sees: revenue, contacts, active contracts ↓ cross-sell opportunity evaluated responsibly."]},{"heading":"444. STRONG","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"445. GROUP REPORTING DEMO","paragraphs":["Subsidiary A ERP Subsidiary B ERP Subsidiary C ERP ↓ mapping ↓ validation ↓ common KPI ↓ group dashboard."]},{"heading":"446. SHARED SERVICES DEMO","paragraphs":["Subsidiary submits: legal request ↓ category ↓ priority ↓ owner ↓ SLA ↓ response ↓ closure ↓ analytics."]},{"heading":"447. M&A DEMO","paragraphs":["Acquisition completed ↓ entity registered ↓ systems inventoried ↓ data owners mapped ↓ access onboarded ↓ group reporting connected ↓ integration milestones tracked."]},{"heading":"448. GROUP PROCUREMENT DEMO","paragraphs":["Supplier appears: in 5 subsidiaries ↓ records matched ↓ total spend calculated ↓ contracts visible ↓ group negotiation opportunity identified."]},{"heading":"449. CORPORATE GROUP PROPOSAL","paragraphs":["Should cover: Group structure Legal entities Countries Business units Current systems Data ownership Central vs local processes Security/access boundaries Integration model Governance Pilot scope Rollout/adoption."]},{"heading":"450. NUMBER OF SUBSIDIARIES MATTERS","paragraphs":[]}]],["Σημεία 451–475 · NUMBER OF COUNTRIES MATTERS",[{"heading":"451. NUMBER OF COUNTRIES MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"452. NUMBER OF SYSTEMS MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"453. DATA VOLUME MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"454. BUSINESS DIVERSITY MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"455. DECISION RIGHTS MATTER","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"456. LOCAL AUTONOMY MATTERS","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"457. PHASED IMPLEMENTATION","paragraphs":["Example: Phase 1 3 subsidiaries + group reporting. Phase 2 Master data + shared services. Phase 3 Broader group rollout."]},{"heading":"458. M&A EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["Phase 1 Day-1 visibility. Phase 2 Finance/HR/security integration. Phase 3 Process/platform consolidation."]},{"heading":"459. GROUP DATA EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["Phase 1 Finance. Phase 2 Customer/supplier. Phase 3 Cross-business analytics."]},{"heading":"460. CORPORATE GROUP AI OPPORTUNITIES","paragraphs":["Potentially: Group knowledge search Contract extraction Policy search Internal support assistant Group reporting assistance Procurement analytics M&A document analysis."]},{"heading":"461. AI KNOWLEDGE","paragraphs":["Very powerful: but: permissions are critical."]},{"heading":"462. AI CONTRACT","paragraphs":["Can extract: dates, entities, commercial terms."]},{"heading":"463. Needs:","paragraphs":["legal review."]},{"heading":"464. AI PROCUREMENT","paragraphs":["Could: cluster suppliers, identify duplicate spend."]},{"heading":"465. Need:","paragraphs":["clean supplier master."]},{"heading":"466. AI REPORTING","paragraphs":["Could summarize: approved KPIs."]},{"heading":"467. Must not:","paragraphs":["invent financial numbers."]},{"heading":"468. AI M&A","paragraphs":["Could: classify documents, summarize systems/information."]},{"heading":"469. But:","paragraphs":["strategic/legal decisions: remain human."]},{"heading":"470. DON'T CLAIM","paragraphs":["«AI will unify the group.»"]},{"heading":"471. DON'T CLAIM","paragraphs":["«One platform will solve all subsidiaries.»"]},{"heading":"472. DON'T CLAIM","paragraphs":["«We should replace every ERP.»"]},{"heading":"473. DON'T CLAIM","paragraphs":["«All data should be centralized.»"]},{"heading":"474. DON'T CLAIM","paragraphs":["«Every subsidiary should work identically.»"]},{"heading":"475. CORPORATE GROUP VALUE HYPOTHESIS EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["FACT: Group acquired three companies. CHANGE: More systems/entities/data. POSSIBLE PROBLEM: Reporting and data governance become more fragmented. IMPACT: Slower consolidation + more reconciliation + weaker visibility. CAPABILITY: Federated integration/data platform. QUESTION: «As the group integrates new companies, which data and reporting domain is becoming hardest to standardize without disrupting local operations?»"]}]],["Σημεία 476–500 · ANOTHER",[{"heading":"476. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["FACT: Group launching shared services. CHANGE: More processes move centrally. POSSIBLE PROBLEM: Internal requests and approvals become bottleneck. IMPACT: Slow service + poor local adoption. CAPABILITY: Shared-services workflow platform. QUESTION: «Which internal service process is hardest to centralize while still keeping subsidiaries responsive to their local business needs?»"]},{"heading":"477. FACT ≠ CONCLUSION","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"478. CORPORATE GROUP SALES OPENING #1","paragraphs":["«Θα ήθελα να καταλάβω ποια process today requires the most manual coordination between Group and subsidiaries.»"]},{"heading":"479. OPENING #2","paragraphs":["«Which group KPI is hardest to trust because every subsidiary produces it differently;»"]},{"heading":"480. OPENING #3","paragraphs":["«Where does central governance create value today and where does it create unnecessary friction for local companies;»"]},{"heading":"481. VERY STRONG","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"482. OPENING #4","paragraphs":["«If the group acquired five additional companies tomorrow, which central process would struggle first to onboard them;»"]},{"heading":"483. OPENING #5","paragraphs":["«Which customer, supplier or financial data has the biggest consistency problem across legal entities;»"]},{"heading":"484. OPENING #6","paragraphs":["«Ποια business process today requires people to manually bridge different ERP, CRM or reporting systems across subsidiaries;»"]},{"heading":"485. WHAT NOT TO SAY","paragraphs":["«Χρειάζεστε ένα ERP για όλο τον όμιλο.»"]},{"heading":"486. DON'T SAY","paragraphs":["«Όλες οι θυγατρικές πρέπει να δουλεύουν το ίδιο.»"]},{"heading":"487. DON'T SAY","paragraphs":["«We'll centralize all data.»"]},{"heading":"488. DON'T SAY","paragraphs":["«AI can access everything.»"]},{"heading":"489. DON'T SAY","paragraphs":["«Local systems are the problem.»"]},{"heading":"490. DON'T SAY","paragraphs":["«Centralization is always better.»"]},{"heading":"491. KEY CORPORATE GROUP TERMS","paragraphs":["Salesperson should know: Parent Company Subsidiary Business Unit Shared Services MDM Intercompany Group Consolidation Enterprise Architecture Data Governance Application Portfolio."]},{"heading":"492. ALSO","paragraphs":["Holding Company Federated Model Group Procurement M&A Integration Legal Entity Shared Service Center Group Policy Synergy."]},{"heading":"493. CORPORATE GROUP DISCOVERY CARD","paragraphs":["Number of Subsidiaries [ ] Countries [ ] Business Units [ ] ERP Systems [ ] CRM Systems [ ] HR Systems [ ] Data Platforms [ ] Identity Systems [ ] Group Reporting Process [ ] Main Shared Service [ ] Main MDM Issue [ ] Main Intercompany Issue [ ] Main Integration Gap [ ] Main Adoption Risk [ ] Group Sponsor [ ] Technical Owner [ ] Business-Unit Stakeholders [ ] Economic Buyer [ ]"]},{"heading":"494. QUALIFICATION","paragraphs":["Group-level pain measurable? Cross-company impact? Group sponsor has authority? Business units involved? Data ownership defined? Architecture feasible? Security/access boundaries understood? Timing/budget real?"]},{"heading":"495. CORPORATE GROUP OPPORTUNITY SCORE","paragraphs":["Group pain __/5 Business/financial impact __/5 Technical/data feasibility __/5 Governance/adoption feasibility __/5 Executive sponsorship __/5 Timing/strategic fit __/5 Total: /30."]},{"heading":"496. 26–30","paragraphs":["Strong."]},{"heading":"497. 20–25","paragraphs":["Good."]},{"heading":"498. 14–19","paragraphs":["Early/risky."]},{"heading":"499. Below 14","paragraphs":["Do not overinvest."]},{"heading":"500. ROLE PLAY 1","paragraphs":["Group CFO: «Χάνουμε εβδομάδες στο consolidation.» Sales: «Πού βρίσκεται το μεγαλύτερο μέρος του manual effort — data collection, account mapping, intercompany reconciliation, validation or management adjustments;»"]}]],["Σημεία 501–517 · ROLE PLAY 2",[{"heading":"501. ROLE PLAY 2","paragraphs":["Group CIO: «Έχουμε 14 ERP systems.» Sales: «Ποιο business process suffers most because of that fragmentation? If the biggest pain is reporting or supplier/customer data, full ERP replacement may not be the first move.»"]},{"heading":"502. ROLE PLAY 3","paragraphs":["Group COO: «Θέλω όλες οι εταιρείες να δουλεύουν το ίδιο.» Sales: «Θα ξεχώριζα πρώτα which processes benefit from group standardization and which local differences are actually necessary for each business model or country.»"]},{"heading":"503. ROLE PLAY 4","paragraphs":["Subsidiary CEO: «Το central system δεν μας βοηθά.» Sales: «Which local workflow does the central model make harder, and what group control still genuinely needs to remain common;»"]},{"heading":"504. ROLE PLAY 5","paragraphs":["Procurement Director: «Δεν ξέρουμε τι αγοράζει κάθε εταιρεία.» Sales: «Is the first problem supplier identity, contract visibility, spend classification or the absence of a common procurement data model;»"]},{"heading":"505. ROLE PLAY 6","paragraphs":["Chief Data Officer: «Θέλω one source of truth.» Sales: «For which data domains? In a large group it may be more realistic to define authoritative sources by domain and build governed integration rather than force every system into one database.»"]},{"heading":"506. ROLE PLAY 7","paragraphs":["CEO: «Τι μπορείτε να κάνετε για τον όμιλο;» Sales: «Θα ξεκινούσα από τέσσερα σημεία: ποιο group report χρειάζεται ακόμη manual reconciliation, πού subsidiaries χρησιμοποιούν διαφορετικές definitions για τα ίδια data, πού shared processes δημιουργούν friction και πού acquisitions έχουν αφήσει duplicate systems or data silos.»"]},{"heading":"507. ROLE PLAY 8","paragraphs":["Customer: «Θέλουμε AI assistant για όλες τις εταιρείες.» Sales: «Θα ξεκινούσα από permissions, entity boundaries and approved knowledge sources. Σε όμιλο, το πιο σημαντικό δεν είναι μόνο να βρίσκει απάντηση το AI αλλά να γνωρίζει ποια πληροφορία επιτρέπεται να δώσει σε κάθε χρήστη.»"]},{"heading":"508. ROLE PLAY 9","paragraphs":["Customer: «Θέλουμε να αντικαταστήσουμε όλα τα systems.» Sales: «Πριν αποφασίσουμε replacement, θα ήθελα να ξεχωρίσουμε business pain caused by systems from pain caused by data definitions, process fragmentation or governance. Different root cause may need very different investment.»"]},{"heading":"509. ROLE PLAY 10","paragraphs":["M&A Director: «Μόλις αγοράσαμε άλλη εταιρεία.» Sales: «What must be visible at group level in the first 30–90 days — finance, people, customers, suppliers, security, systems — and which parts can remain locally independent initially;»"]},{"heading":"510. ACCOUNT EXPANSION","paragraphs":["Successful: group reporting. Could expand: to: MDM supplier analytics intercompany budgeting."]},{"heading":"511. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["Shared-service portal ↓ internal SLAs ↓ workflow automation ↓ knowledge assistant."]},{"heading":"512. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["M&A integration ↓ application rationalization ↓ data governance ↓ shared platforms."]},{"heading":"513. ANOTHER","paragraphs":["Customer master ↓ group customer 360 ↓ strategic account coordination."]},{"heading":"514. BUT","paragraphs":["always: new discovery local stakeholder involvement business case."]},{"heading":"515. CORPORATE GROUP GOLDEN RULE","paragraphs":["«Σε έναν μεγάλο όμιλο η μεγαλύτερη software ευκαιρία βρίσκεται συνήθως όχι στο ότι οι θυγατρικές χρησιμοποιούν διαφορετικά systems, αλλά στο ότι ο όμιλος δεν μπορεί να συνδέσει με αξιόπιστο τρόπο τα data, τις αποφάσεις και τα workflows που πραγματικά πρέπει να είναι κοινά.»"]},{"heading":"516. Η ΤΕΛΙΚΗ ΡΟΗ","paragraphs":["RESEARCH GROUP / SUBSIDIARIES / ACQUISITIONS ↓ IDENTIFY GROUP-LEVEL TRIGGER ↓ SPEAK TO GROUP PROCESS OWNER ↓ MAP CENTRAL VS LOCAL RESPONSIBILITIES ↓ IDENTIFY CROSS-COMPANY DATA / PROCESS GAPS ↓ QUANTIFY REPORTING / COST / CONTROL / ADOPTION IMPACT ↓ INVOLVE GROUP CIO / CFO / COO / DATA + BUSINESS UNITS ↓ MAP ERP / CRM / HR / DATA / IDENTITY LANDSCAPE ↓ IDENTIFY AUTHORITATIVE SOURCES BY DOMAIN ↓ DEFINE WHAT SHOULD BE STANDARDIZED ↓ DEFINE WHAT SHOULD REMAIN LOCAL ↓ BUILD BUSINESS CASE ↓ PILOT WITH REPRESENTATIVE SUBSIDIARIES ↓ VALIDATE DATA + GOVERNANCE + LOCAL ADOPTION ↓ SCALE IN PHASES ↓ MEASURE GROUP VALUE ↓ EXPAND RESPONSIBLY."]},{"heading":"517. Η ΜΙΑ ΦΡΑΣΗ ΠΟΥ ΠΡΕΠΕΙ ΝΑ ΘΥΜΑΤΑΙ Η ΟΜΑΔΑ","paragraphs":["«Σε Corporate Groups & Conglomerates δεν ξεκινάμε ρωτώντας “θέλετε ένα κεντρικό ERP, data lake ή AI για όλο τον όμιλο;”. Ξεκινάμε από το ποια πληροφορία και ποια απόφαση πρέπει πραγματικά να είναι κοινή, πού οι θυγατρικές ξανακάνουν την ίδια δουλειά, πού το Group Management δεν εμπιστεύεται τα συγκεντρωτικά data και πώς μπορούμε να δημιουργήσουμε group-level control χωρίς να καταστρέψουμε τη λειτουργία που χρειάζεται να παραμείνει τοπική.» Αυτό είναι: DISTILLOGIC CORPORATE GROUPS & CONGLOMERATES PLAYBOOK."]}]],["Πριν απαντήσεις στο quiz",["Ξανασκέψου το εισαγωγικό περιστατικό. Ποιο γεγονός είναι επιβεβαιωμένο, ποια πληροφορία λείπει και ποια ενέργεια θα μείωνε την αβεβαιότητα; Μία απάντηση μπορεί να ακούγεται εμπορικά ελκυστική αλλά να προηγείται της απαιτούμενης επιβεβαίωσης.","Οι δύο ερωτήσεις εφαρμογής γενικών αρχών συνδέονται και με τις προαιρετικές «Γενικές σημειώσεις». Το PDF βρίσκεται μόνιμα στο μενού, δεν αποτελεί ξεχωριστό υποχρεωτικό μάθημα και η ανάγνωσή του δεν βαθμολογείται.","Η επάνοδος χρειάζεται λόγο, συνάφεια και σεβασμό ορίων. Γενικές σημειώσεις: follow-up.","Μια ερμηνεία δεν είναι ακόμη τεκμηριωμένη αιτία. Γενικές σημειώσεις: learning orientation και ανασκόπηση."]]],"scenario":["Όμιλος έχει διαφορετικά ERP ανά θυγατρική και χρειάζεται κοινή αναφορά χωρίς να διακόψει τις τοπικές λειτουργίες.","Χαρτογράφηση πηγών, κοινών ορισμών και τοπικών περιορισμών πριν αποφασιστεί integration ή αντικατάσταση. Η ενοποίηση πληροφορίας δεν επιβάλλει αυτόματα ένα ίδιο σύστημα παντού."],"minutes":49,"version":1,"additional_curriculum":37,"question_rows":[["Όμιλος έχει διαφορετικά ERP ανά θυγατρική και χρειάζεται κοινή αναφορά χωρίς να διακόψει τις τοπικές λειτουργίες. Ποια αρχική προσέγγιση είναι συνετή;","Χαρτογράφηση πηγών, κοινών ορισμών και τοπικών περιορισμών πριν αποφασιστεί integration ή αντικατάσταση.","Αντικατάσταση όλων των ERP επειδή διαφέρουν οι προμηθευτές.","Ένωση όλων των αρχείων χωρίς έλεγχο λογαριασμών και ορισμών.","Κοινός κωδικός πρόσβασης διοίκησης για όλες τις θυγατρικές.","Η ενοποίηση πληροφορίας δεν επιβάλλει αυτόματα ένα ίδιο σύστημα παντού."],["Όμιλος έχει διαφορετικά ERP ανά θυγατρική και χρειάζεται κοινή αναφορά χωρίς να διακόψει τις τοπικές λειτουργίες. Δύο θυγατρικές αναφέρουν διαφορετικό «ενεργό πελάτη». Τι λείπει;","Συμφωνημένος ορισμός και κανόνας αντιστοίχισης για τον συγκεκριμένο δείκτη.","Μόνο γρηγορότερη βάση δεδομένων.","Μόνο νέο χρώμα στο dashboard.","Μόνο περισσότερη εκπαίδευση πωλήσεων.","Η τεχνική ενοποίηση δεν λύνει ασυνεπείς επιχειρησιακές έννοιες."],["Όμιλος έχει διαφορετικά ERP ανά θυγατρική και χρειάζεται κοινή αναφορά χωρίς να διακόψει τις τοπικές λειτουργίες. Ποιος πιλότος μειώνει κίνδυνο;","Λίγες αντιπροσωπευτικές θυγατρικές και συγκεκριμένη αναφορά με κριτήρια συμφωνίας δεδομένων.","Όλος ο όμιλος χωρίς τοπικούς υπευθύνους.","Μόνο δεδομένα της πιο απλής θυγατρικής χωρίς έλεγχο εξαιρέσεων.","Μόνο demo με πλασματική δομή λογαριασμών άσχετη με τον όμιλο.","Η αντιπροσωπευτικότητα και η συμμετοχή των τοπικών ομάδων είναι ουσιαστικές."],["Ο πελάτης δεν απαντά μετά από αίτημα προσφοράς. Έχεις νέο στοιχείο σχετικό με την ανάγκη και δεν υπάρχει αίτημα διακοπής. Ποιο follow-up έχει μεγαλύτερη αξία;","Σύντομη σύνδεση με την προηγούμενη συζήτηση, νέο χρήσιμο στοιχείο και εύκολη πρόταση επόμενου βήματος μέσω επιτρεπόμενου καναλιού.","Το ίδιο «είδατε την προσφορά;» κάθε ημέρα σε όλα τα κανάλια.","Αυτόματη δήλωση αποδοχής αν δεν υπάρξει απάντηση.","Αποστολή νέας έκπτωσης πριν διευκρινιστεί ο λόγος σιωπής.","Η επάνοδος χρειάζεται λόγο, συνάφεια και σεβασμό ορίων. Γενικές σημειώσεις: follow-up."],["Σε ανασκόπηση χαμένης ευκαιρίας ο πωλητής λέει «μας κέρδισε η τιμή». Ποιο επόμενο βήμα παράγει μάθηση;","Ελέγχουμε στοιχεία και feedback για κριτήρια απόφασης, ανταγωνισμό, αδράνεια και στάδια που δεν επιβεβαιώθηκαν.","Καταγράφουμε αυτόματα ανταγωνιστή ως αιτία χωρίς στοιχεία.","Μειώνουμε οριζόντια όλες τις μελλοντικές τιμές.","Διαγράφουμε την ευκαιρία ώστε να μη μειώσει το ποσοστό επιτυχίας.","Μια ερμηνεία δεν είναι ακόμη τεκμηριωμένη αιτία. Γενικές σημειώσεις: learning orientation και ανασκόπηση."]],"source_note":"Πηγή: ΜΑΘΗΜΑ 31.docx, κεφάλαιο 49. Διατηρείται το κείμενο των αριθμημένων σημείων, με ενοποίηση των σπασμένων γραμμών και αφαίρεση επαναλαμβανόμενης μορφοποίησης. Τα παραδείγματα δεν αλλάζουν τους κανόνες της εφαρμογής."},"di-enterprise-50":{"pillar":"distillogic","title":"50. Δημόσιος τομέας και εκπαίδευση","goal":"Να αναγνωρίζεις πραγματικές ανάγκες, να διερευνάς τα στοιχεία και να επιλέγεις υπεύθυνο επόμενο βήμα.","sections":[["Από την έννοια στην επαγγελματική πράξη",["Πανεπιστήμιο δέχεται online αιτήσεις, αλλά τις ανακαταχωρίζει χειροκίνητα σε συστήματα φοιτητών και οικονομικών.","Στη μελέτη που ακολουθεί σύνδεσε κάθε πιθανή λύση με συγκεκριμένη διαδικασία, υπεύθυνο, επίπτωση και στοιχεία που μπορούν να επαληθευτούν. Η τεχνική δυνατότητα, η οικονομική αξία και η εξουσιοδότηση για απόφαση είναι διαφορετικά ερωτήματα. Τα παραδείγματα του κεφαλαίου σε βοηθούν να τα διερευνάς χωρίς να υπόσχεσαι κάτι που δεν έχει εγκριθεί.","Η ύλη περιγράφει ενδεικτικές επιχειρηματικές ανάγκες και μεθόδους πώλησης. Δεν αποτελεί κατάλογο έτοιμων λειτουργιών των δύο CRM, δεσμευτική προσφορά, αλλαγή αμοιβών ή νέα πολιτική πιστοποίησης. Για πραγματική εργασία ισχύουν οι εγκεκριμένοι εταιρικοί όροι και οι αρμοδιότητες. Το μάθημα 60 είναι προετοιμασία, όχι δεύτερη επίσημη τελική εξέταση."]],["Το αντικείμενο του κεφαλαίου",["ΔΗΜΟΣΙΟΣ ΤΟΜΕΑΣ & ΕΚΠΑΙΔΕΥΣΗ Πώς πουλάμε software και technology services σε δημόσιους οργανισμούς, δήμους, περιφέρειες, πανεπιστήμια, εκπαιδευτικούς οργανισμούς και μεγάλους θεσμικούς φορείς"]],["Σημεία 1–25 · Η ΒΑΣΙΚΗ ΑΡΧΗ",[{"heading":"1. Η ΒΑΣΙΚΗ ΑΡΧΗ","paragraphs":["Στο Public Sector & Education: δεν πουλάμε: «ένα portal». Δεν πουλάμε: «digital transformation». Πουλάμε: ΠΙΟ ΑΠΛΕΣ ΥΠΗΡΕΣΙΕΣ, ΛΙΓΟΤΕΡΗ ΓΡΑΦΕΙΟΚΡΑΤΙΑ, ΚΑΛΥΤΕΡΗ ΡΟΗ ΥΠΟΘΕΣΕΩΝ, ΚΑΛΥΤΕΡΗ ΠΡΟΣΒΑΣΗ ΣΤΗΝ ΠΛΗΡΟΦΟΡΙΑ ΚΑΙ ΠΙΟ ΑΞΙΟΠΙΣΤΗ ΕΞΥΠΗΡΕΤΗΣΗ ΠΟΛΙΤΗ Ή ΦΟΙΤΗΤΗ."]},{"heading":"2. ΤΙ ΜΠΟΡΕΙ ΝΑ ΕΙΝΑΙ PUBLIC-SECTOR CUSTOMER","paragraphs":["Υπουργείο Δήμος Περιφέρεια Δημόσιος οργανισμός Δημόσια επιχείρηση Ανεξάρτητη αρχή Νοσοκομειακός οργανισμός Πανεπιστήμιο Ερευνητικό ίδρυμα Εκπαιδευτικός οργανισμός Μεγάλος φορέας κατάρτισης."]},{"heading":"3. Η ΒΑΣΙΚΗ PUBLIC-SERVICE ΡΟΗ","paragraphs":["Citizen / Business ↓ Request / Application ↓ Document Submission ↓ Validation ↓ Internal Review ↓ Approval ↓ Decision ↓ Notification ↓ Payment / Permit / Service / Certificate."]},{"heading":"4. ΣΤΗΝ ΕΚΠΑΙΔΕΥΣΗ","paragraphs":["Prospective Student ↓ Application ↓ Admission ↓ Enrollment ↓ Courses ↓ Attendance / Assessment ↓ Student Services ↓ Graduation ↓ Alumni."]},{"heading":"5. ΤΟ ΜΕΓΑΛΟ PROBLEM","paragraphs":["Συχνά υπάρχει: Digital front-end αλλά: MANUAL BACK-OFFICE."]},{"heading":"6. Ο ΠΟΛΙΤΗΣ ΒΛΕΠΕΙ","paragraphs":["μία φόρμα."]},{"heading":"7. ΠΙΣΩ ΑΠΟ ΤΗ ΦΟΡΜΑ","paragraphs":["μπορεί να υπάρχουν: email, Excel, paper, multiple approvals, manual re-entry."]},{"heading":"8. ΑΥΤΟ ΕΙΝΑΙ","paragraphs":["τεράστια: software opportunity."]},{"heading":"9. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #1","paragraphs":["CITIZEN REQUEST MANAGEMENT Πολίτης: κάνει αίτημα."]},{"heading":"10. Μετά ρωτά:","paragraphs":["«Τι έγινε με την υπόθεσή μου;»"]},{"heading":"11. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Case management."]},{"heading":"12. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Από τη στιγμή που υποβάλλεται ένα αίτημα μέχρι να κλείσει, μπορείτε να δείτε owner, status, pending action και deadline από ένα σημείο;»"]},{"heading":"13. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #2","paragraphs":["CASE OWNERSHIP Request enters: shared inbox."]},{"heading":"14. Nobody knows:","paragraphs":["who owns it."]},{"heading":"15. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Automatic assignment."]},{"heading":"16. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς γνωρίζει σήμερα η διοίκηση ποιος έχει την ευθύνη κάθε ανοιχτής υπόθεσης;»"]},{"heading":"17. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #3","paragraphs":["CASE STATUS Citizen calls: again and again."]},{"heading":"18. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Self-service tracking."]},{"heading":"19. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Τι ποσοστό τηλεφωνημάτων αφορά μόνο ενημέρωση για status;»"]},{"heading":"20. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #4","paragraphs":["DOCUMENT SUBMISSION Citizen sends: application, ID, certificates, supporting docs."]},{"heading":"21. PROBLEM","paragraphs":["Missing documents."]},{"heading":"22. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Document checklist + portal."]},{"heading":"23. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσες υποθέσεις καθυστερούν επειδή ο φάκελος δεν ήταν complete at first submission;»"]},{"heading":"24. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #5","paragraphs":["DOCUMENT VALIDATION Employee checks: manually: whether documents exist and are valid."]},{"heading":"25. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Validation workflow / assisted extraction."]}]],["Σημεία 26–50 · DISCOVERY QUESTION",[{"heading":"26. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποιο document type δημιουργεί το μεγαλύτερο manual checking workload;»"]},{"heading":"27. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #6","paragraphs":["DUPLICATE DATA ENTRY Citizen enters: data online. Employee: re-enters: into internal system."]},{"heading":"28. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Integration."]},{"heading":"29. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποια δεδομένα γράφονται ξανά με το χέρι αφού ο πολίτης τα έχει ήδη υποβάλει ψηφιακά;»"]},{"heading":"30. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #7","paragraphs":["MULTIPLE DEPARTMENTS One case: moves: from Department A to B to C."]},{"heading":"31. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Cross-department workflow."]},{"heading":"32. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πού χάνεται σήμερα περισσότερο χρόνος όταν μία υπόθεση περνά από ένα department σε άλλο;»"]},{"heading":"33. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #8","paragraphs":["APPROVAL CHAINS One application: needs: multiple approvals."]},{"heading":"34. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Digital approval workflow."]},{"heading":"35. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποιο approval level δημιουργεί το μεγαλύτερο waiting time σήμερα;»"]},{"heading":"36. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #9","paragraphs":["PAPER SIGNATURES Documents: printed, signed, scanned."]},{"heading":"37. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Electronic-signature workflow."]},{"heading":"38. IMPORTANT","paragraphs":["Legal validity: must be verified."]},{"heading":"39. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #10","paragraphs":["PHYSICAL FILE MOVEMENT Folder: moves: between offices."]},{"heading":"40. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Digital case file."]},{"heading":"41. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποια διαδικασία εξακολουθεί να εξαρτάται από physical movement of paper files;»"]},{"heading":"42. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #11","paragraphs":["DOCUMENT SEARCH Employee asks: «Πού είναι ο φάκελος;»"]},{"heading":"43. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Searchable document repository."]},{"heading":"44. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο χρόνο χάνουν employees searching for the right document or version;»"]},{"heading":"45. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #12","paragraphs":["VERSION CONTROL Policy/procedure/document: many versions."]},{"heading":"46. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Controlled document management."]},{"heading":"47. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς διασφαλίζετε ότι staff χρησιμοποιεί την latest approved version;»"]},{"heading":"48. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #13","paragraphs":["CERTIFICATE ISSUANCE Citizen needs: certificate."]},{"heading":"49. Process may be:","paragraphs":["manual."]},{"heading":"50. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Automated certificate workflow."]}]],["Σημεία 51–75 · DISCOVERY QUESTION",[{"heading":"51. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποιο certificate or standard document απαιτεί σήμερα το μεγαλύτερο manual processing despite having structured data available;»"]},{"heading":"52. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #14","paragraphs":["PERMIT / LICENSE PROCESS Application ↓ documents ↓ review ↓ approval ↓ permit."]},{"heading":"53. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Permit management system."]},{"heading":"54. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποιο step δημιουργεί τη μεγαλύτερη καθυστέρηση από application μέχρι final permit;»"]},{"heading":"55. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #15","paragraphs":["INSPECTIONS Public bodies may perform: site inspections, compliance inspections, audits."]},{"heading":"56. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Mobile inspection app."]},{"heading":"57. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσες inspections καταγράφονται ακόμη σε paper, PDF or disconnected spreadsheets;»"]},{"heading":"58. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #16","paragraphs":["INSPECTION FINDINGS Issue found. Need: corrective action."]},{"heading":"59. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Finding → action → closure workflow."]},{"heading":"60. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πώς παρακολουθείτε finding from inspection until final remediation;»"]},{"heading":"61. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #17","paragraphs":["PUBLIC COMPLAINTS Citizen submits: complaint."]},{"heading":"62. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Complaint case management."]},{"heading":"63. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Ποια complaint categories repeat most often and where do they usually stall;»"]},{"heading":"64. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #18","paragraphs":["REQUEST CLASSIFICATION Citizen sends: free-text request."]},{"heading":"65. Need:","paragraphs":["route: to correct unit."]},{"heading":"66. OPPORTUNITY","paragraphs":["Classification/routing automation."]},{"heading":"67. DISCOVERY QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Πόσο manual είναι η ταξινόμηση και προώθηση εισερχόμενων αιτημάτων σήμερα;»"]},{"heading":"68. ΚΥΡΙΟ PAIN #19","paragraphs":["CONTACT CENTER Citizens call for: status, requirements, ap