d."]},{"heading":"335. This Academy:","paragraphs":["itself: becomes: sales knowledge system."]},{"heading":"336. GOVERNANCE DOES NOT MEAN","paragraphs":["salespeople: cannot think."]},{"heading":"337. We want:","paragraphs":["autonomy: inside: clear boundaries."]},{"heading":"338. Example:","paragraphs":["Seller can: write outreach."]},{"heading":"339. But Tier A:","paragraphs":["reviewed."]},{"heading":"340. Seller can:","paragraphs":["run discovery."]},{"heading":"341. But cannot:","paragraphs":["promise architecture."]},{"heading":"342. Seller can:","paragraphs":["negotiate."]},{"heading":"343. But large discount:","paragraphs":["approval."]},{"heading":"344. Seller can:","paragraphs":["build relationship."]},{"heading":"345. But cannot:","paragraphs":["make secret commitments."]},{"heading":"346. THIS IS","paragraphs":["CONTROLLED AUTONOMY."]},{"heading":"347. TOO LITTLE GOVERNANCE","paragraphs":["creates: chaos."]},{"heading":"348. TOO MUCH GOVERNANCE","paragraphs":["creates: slow sales."]},{"heading":"349. Need:","paragraphs":["balance."]},{"heading":"350. Governance should be:","paragraphs":["strongest: where risk highest."]}]],["Σημεία 351–375 · Tier A:",[{"heading":"351. Tier A:","paragraphs":["more control."]},{"heading":"352. Large deal:","paragraphs":["more control."]},{"heading":"353. Security-sensitive:","paragraphs":["more control."]},{"heading":"354. Small low-risk project:","paragraphs":["lighter process."]},{"heading":"355. RISK-BASED GOVERNANCE","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"356. EXAMPLE","paragraphs":["€5k website: doesn't need: same approval chain: as: €500k banking platform."]},{"heading":"357. Very important.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"358. DEAL DESK","paragraphs":["As company grows: create: Deal Desk."]},{"heading":"359. Deal Desk:","paragraphs":["coordinates: complex opportunities."]},{"heading":"360. May include:","paragraphs":["Sales Finance Legal Delivery Security."]},{"heading":"361. Used for:","paragraphs":["large/high-risk deals."]}