hips handed over Access removed Pending commitments transferred."]},{"heading":"437. Customer relationship:","paragraphs":["belongs: to company, not: personal spreadsheet."]},{"heading":"438. This is why:","paragraphs":["CRM matters."]},{"heading":"439. ONBOARDING SALESPERSON","paragraphs":["Before access: Sales policy CRM training Account rules Pricing authority Confidentiality Escalation rules."]},{"heading":"440. Then:","paragraphs":["appropriate permissions."]},{"heading":"441. TEAM LEADER CHECKLIST","paragraphs":["Weekly: CRM health Tier A status Proposals pending Commercial exceptions Presales load Stuck procurement Upcoming close/staffing needs."]},{"heading":"442. CEO CHECKLIST","paragraphs":["Monthly: Revenue Qualified pipeline Forecast Strategic deals Major risks Margin Delivery capacity."]},{"heading":"443. CEO does not need:","paragraphs":["to review: every email."]},{"heading":"444. SALES OPS SHOULD","paragraphs":["give leadership: visibility: without micromanagement."]},{"heading":"445. ROLEPLAY 1","paragraphs":["Seller: «Customer needs proposal tomorrow.» Team Leader: «Is scope technically validated?»"]},{"heading":"446. Seller:","paragraphs":["«Not fully.»"]},{"heading":"447. Correct:","paragraphs":["send: preliminary range/approach or: delay final proposal."]},{"heading":"448. Not:","paragraphs":["invent."]},{"heading":"449. ROLEPLAY 2","paragraphs":["Seller: «I promised 8 weeks.» Team Leader: «Who from Delivery approved that?»"]},{"heading":"450. If nobody:","paragraphs":["problem."]}]],["Σημεία 451–475 · Correct immediately.",[{"heading":"451. Correct immediately.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"452. ROLEPLAY 3","paragraphs":["Developer: «I told the client we'd add that feature.» Team Leader: «Has scope/commercial impact been assessed?»"]},{"heading":"453. If no:","paragraphs":["need: change process."]},{"heading":"454. ROLEPLAY 4","paragraphs":["Customer: asks: legal liability question. Seller: «I think it's fine.»"]},{"heading":"455. Wrong.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"456. Correct:","paragraphs":["«I'll have Legal confirm.»"]},{"heading":"457. ROLEPLAY 5","paragraphs":["Customer: asks: for 20% discount. Seller: offers: 15%."]},{"heading":"458. Without approval:","paragraphs":["wrong."]},{"heading":"459. Role:","paragraphs":["commercial escalation."]},{"heading":"460. ROLEPLAY 6","paragraphs":["Tier A account: two sellers: contact different executives: same day."]},{"heading":"461. Wrong.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"462. Account Owner:","paragraphs":["should coordinate."]},{"heading":"463. ROLEPLAY 7","paragraphs":["Customer: signs. Salesperson: disappears."]},{"heading":"464. Wrong.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"465. Account Owner:","paragraphs":["stays involved."]},{"heading":"466. ROLEPLAY 8","paragraphs":["Delivery: says: «We didn't know customer expected mobile app.»"]},{"heading":"467. Handoff failed.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"468. Need:","paragraphs":["promise/scope audit."]},{"heading":"469. ROLEPLAY 9","paragraphs":["Finance: discovers: 90-day payment: after signature."]},{"heading":"470. Commercial governance failed.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"471. ROLEPLAY 10","paragraphs":["Security: finds: customer requirement: not supported: after proposal."]},{"heading":"472. Security entered:","paragraphs":["too late."]},{"heading":"473. ROLEPLAY 11","paragraphs":["Customer: asks: «Who is our single point of contact?»"]},{"heading":"474. Answer:","paragraphs":["must be: clear."]},{"heading":"475. Project:","paragraphs":["PM."]}]],["Σημεία 476–499 · Relationship/commercial:",[{"heading":"476. Relationship/commercial:","paragraphs":["Account Owner."]},{"heading":"477. Clarify roles.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"478. ROLEPLAY 12","paragraphs":["CEO: gets: 50 approval requests/day."]},{"heading":"479. Problem:","paragraphs":["approval matrix: bad."]},{"heading":"480. Delegate:","paragraphs":["normal decisions."]},{"heading":"481. Escalate:","paragraphs":["exceptions."]},{"heading":"482. SALES GOVERNANCE MATURITY — LEVEL 1","paragraphs":["Everything: in founder's head."]},{"heading":"483. LEVEL 2","paragraphs":["CRM exists."]},{"heading":"484. LEVEL 3","paragraphs":["Stages + approvals defined."]},{"heading":"485. LEVEL 4","paragraphs":["Sales, Technical, Legal, Finance coordinated."]},{"heading":"486. LEVEL 5","paragraphs":["Process scalable: with data, automation and delegation."]},{"heading":"487. DISTILLOGIC TARGET","paragraphs":["LEVEL 4 → LEVEL 5."]},{"heading":"488. SALES OPS GOLDEN RULE #1","paragraphs":["«One Account = One Account Owner.»"]},{"heading":"489. GOLDEN RULE #2","paragraphs":["«No salesperson can commit technical feasibility alone.»"]},{"heading":"490. GOLDEN RULE #3","paragraphs":["«No discount, SLA, payment exception or free work without the right approval.»"]},{"heading":"491. GOLDEN RULE #4","paragraphs":["«Bring Technical, Legal, Security and Finance in when their risk becomes relevant — not after it becomes a problem.»"]},{"heading":"492. GOLDEN RULE #5","paragraphs":["«No proposal leaves the company unless it is commercially and operationally deliverable.»"]},{"heading":"493. GOLDEN RULE #6","paragraphs":["«Every important customer promise must be visible internally.»"]},{"heading":"494. GOLDEN RULE #7","paragraphs":["«Contract, proposal, SOW and PO must tell the same commercial story.»"]},{"heading":"495. GOLDEN RULE #8","paragraphs":["«Sales does not throw the customer over the wall after signature.»"]},{"heading":"496. GOLDEN RULE #9","paragraphs":["«Governance should control high-risk decisions without slowing every small decision.»"]},{"heading":"497. GOLDEN RULE #10","paragraphs":["«A scalable sales organization depends on clear decision rights, not on the founder personally approving everything.»"]},{"heading":"498. Η ΤΕΛΙΚΗ SALES OPERATIONS ΡΟΗ","paragraphs":["ACCOUNT CREATED ↓ ACCOUNT OWNER ASSIGNED ↓ TIER DEFINED ↓ RESEARCH ↓ APPROVED OUTREACH IF TIER A ↓ DISCOVERY ↓ QUALIFICATION GATE ↓ PRESALES REQUEST ↓ TECHNICAL VALIDATION ↓ CAPACITY CHECK ↓ PROPOSAL DRAFT ↓ TECHNICAL + DELIVERY + COMMERCIAL REVIEW ↓ CUSTOMER PROPOSAL ↓ PROCUREMENT / SECURITY / LEGAL ↓ COMMERCIAL EXCEPTIONS APPROVED ↓ FINAL AGREEMENT ↓ CONTRACT / SOW / PO CHECK ↓ CLOSED WON ↓ INTERNAL HANDOFF ↓ CUSTOMER KICKOFF ↓ ACCOUNT MANAGEMENT ↓ VALUE REALIZATION ↓ RESPONSIBLE EXPANSION."]},{"heading":"499. Η ΜΙΑ ΦΡΑΣΗ ΠΟΥ ΠΡΕΠΕΙ ΝΑ ΘΥΜΑΤΑΙ ΟΛΗ Η ΕΤΑΙΡΕΙΑ","paragraphs":["«Η πώληση δεν ανήκει μόνο στο Sales. Το Sales ανοίγει και οδηγεί την εμπορική σχέση, αλλά Technical εγκρίνει τι μπορούμε πραγματικά να χτίσουμε, Delivery τι μπορούμε πραγματικά να παραδώσουμε και πότε, Finance αν οι οικονομικοί όροι είναι υγιείς, Legal και Security αν το ρίσκο είναι αποδεκτό, και ο Account Owner φροντίζει ο πελάτης να ακούει μία ενιαία DISTILLOGIC. Όταν αυτοί οι ρόλοι είναι ξεκάθαροι, η εταιρεία μπορεί να μεγαλώσει χωρίς να εξαρτάται από χάος, μνήμη και προσωπικές συνεννοήσεις.» ΑΥΤΟ ΕΙΝΑΙ ENTERPRISE SALES OPERATIONS & GOVERNANCE."]}]],["Πριν απαντήσεις στο quiz",["Ξανασκέψου το εισαγωγικό περιστατικό. Ποιο γεγονός είναι επιβεβαιωμένο, ποια πληροφορία λείπει και ποια ενέργεια θα μείωνε την αβεβαιότητα; Μία απάντηση μπορεί να ακούγεται εμπορικά ελκυστική αλλά να προηγείται της απαιτούμενης επιβεβαίωσης.","Οι δύο ερωτήσεις εφαρμογής γενικών αρχών συνδέονται και με τις προαιρετικές «Γενικές σημειώσεις». Το PDF βρίσκεται μόνιμα στο μενού, δεν αποτελεί ξεχωριστό υποχρεωτικό μάθημα και η ανάγνωσή του δεν βαθμολογείται.","Η επάνοδος χρειάζεται λόγο, συνάφεια και σεβασμό ορίων. Γενικές σημειώσεις: follow-up.","Μια ερμηνεία δεν είναι ακόμη τεκμηριωμένη αιτία. Γενικές σημειώσεις: learning orientation και ανασκόπηση."]]],"scenario":["Το Sales έχει υποσχεθεί custom integration, το Delivery δεν το έχει εκτιμήσει και το Finance δεν γνωρίζει τους νέους όρους πληρωμής.","Κοινός έλεγχος αντικειμένου, τεχνικής εφικτότητας, κόστους, όρων και εξουσιοδοτήσεων. Η παράδοση πρέπει να μπορεί να εκτελέσει όσα δεσμεύει η πώληση."],"minutes":34,"version":1,"additional_curriculum":37,"question_rows":[["Το Sales έχει υποσχεθεί custom integration, το Delivery δεν το έχει εκτιμήσει και το Finance δεν γνωρίζει τους νέους όρους πληρωμής. Τι πρέπει να γίνει πριν από εξωτερική δέσμευση;","Κοινός έλεγχος αντικειμένου, τεχνικής εφικτότητας, κόστους, όρων και εξουσιοδοτήσεων.","Αποστολή προσφοράς και εσωτερική ενημέρωση μετά.","Μεταφορά όλης της ευθύνης στον πελάτη μέσω γενικής υποσημείωσης.","Σιωπηρή αφαίρεση της λειτουργίας από το τελικό έργο.","Η παράδοση πρέπει να μπορεί να εκτελέσει όσα δεσμεύει η πώληση."],["Το Sales έχει υποσχεθεί custom integration, το Delivery δεν το έχει εκτιμήσει και το Finance δεν γνωρίζει τους νέους όρους πληρωμής. Τι περιλαμβάνει σωστό handover;","Ανάγκη, συμφωνημένο scope, εξαιρέσεις, όρους, ρίσκα, υπευθύνους και επόμενα βήματα.","Μόνο το όνομα και το τηλέφωνο πελάτη.","Μόνο το υπολογιζόμενο έσοδο.","Μόνο το τελευταίο demo χωρίς τις συζητημένες προϋποθέσεις.","Η συνέχεια απαιτεί το πλαίσιο της συμφωνίας και όχι απλή μεταφορά επαφής."],["Το Sales έχει υποσχεθεί custom integration, το Delivery δεν το έχει εκτιμήσει και το Finance δεν γνωρίζει τους νέους όρους πληρωμής. Ποια ενέργεια διατηρεί λογοδοσία σε εξαίρεση;","Τεκμηριωμένη αιτιολογία, αρμόδια έγκριση και σύνδεση με την τελική έκδοση.","Άτυπη προφορική συνεννόηση χωρίς καταγραφή.","Αλλαγή παλιών εγγραφών για να φαίνεται ότι ο κανόνας τηρήθηκε.","Χρήση λογαριασμού άλλου υπαλλήλου για την έγκριση.","Η εξαίρεση πρέπει να παραμένει ελέγξιμη και συνδεδεμένη με πραγματικό αρμόδιο."],["Ο πελάτης δεν απαντά μετά από αίτημα προσφοράς. Έχεις νέο στοιχείο σχετικό με την ανάγκη και δεν υπάρχει αίτημα διακοπής. Ποιο follow-up έχει μεγαλύτερη αξία;","Σύντομη σύνδεση με την προηγούμενη συζήτηση, νέο χρήσιμο στοιχείο και εύκολη πρόταση επόμενου βήματος μέσω επιτρεπόμενου καναλιού.","Το ίδιο «είδατε την προσφορά;» κάθε ημέρα σε όλα τα κανάλια.","Αυτόματη δήλωση αποδοχής αν δεν υπάρξει απάντηση.","Αποστολή νέας έκπτωσης πριν διευκρινιστεί ο λόγος σιωπής.","Η επάνοδος χρειάζεται λόγο, συνάφεια και σεβασμό ορίων. Γενικές σημειώσεις: follow-up."],["Σε ανασκόπηση χαμένης ευκαιρίας ο πωλητής λέει «μας κέρδισε η τιμή». Ποιο επόμενο βήμα παράγει μάθηση;","Ελέγχουμε στοιχεία και feedback για κριτήρια απόφασης, ανταγωνισμό, αδράνεια και στάδια που δεν επιβεβαιώθηκαν.","Καταγράφουμε αυτόματα ανταγωνιστή ως αιτία χωρίς στοιχεία.","Μειώνουμε οριζόντια όλες τις μελλοντικές τιμές.","Διαγράφουμε την ευκαιρία ώστε να μη μειώσει το ποσοστό επιτυχίας.","Μια ερμηνεία δεν είναι ακόμη τεκμηριωμένη αιτία. Γενικές σημειώσεις: learning orientation και ανασκόπηση."]],"source_note":"Πηγή: ΜΑΘΗΜΑ 31.docx, κεφάλαιο 59. Διατηρείται το κείμενο των αριθμημένων σημείων, με ενοποίηση των σπασμένων γραμμών και αφαίρεση επαναλαμβανόμενης μορφοποίησης. Τα παραδείγματα δεν αλλάζουν τους κανόνες της εφαρμογής."},"di-enterprise-60":{"pillar":"distillogic","title":"60. Ετοιμότητα και σύνθετη αξιολόγηση πωλητή","goal":"Να αναγνωρίζεις πραγματικές ανάγκες, να διερευνάς τα στοιχεία και να επιλέγεις υπεύθυνο επόμενο βήμα.","sections":[["Από την έννοια στην επαγγελματική πράξη",["Εκπαιδευόμενος γνωρίζει τεχνικούς όρους αλλά σε role-play υπόσχεται μη επιβεβαιωμένη διασύνδεση και καταχωρίζει ανακριβές επόμενο βήμα.","Στη μελέτη που ακολουθεί σύνδεσε κάθε πιθανή λύση με συγκεκριμένη διαδικασία, υπεύθυνο, επίπτωση και στοιχεία που μπορούν να επαληθευτούν. Η τεχνική δυνατότητα, η οικονομική αξία και η εξουσιοδότηση για απόφαση είναι διαφορετικά ερωτήματα. Τα παραδείγματα του κεφαλαίου σε βοηθούν να τα διερευνάς χωρίς να υπόσχεσαι κάτι που δεν έχει εγκριθεί.","Η ύλη περιγράφει ενδεικτικές επιχειρηματικές ανάγκες και μεθόδους πώλησης. Δεν αποτελεί κατάλογο έτοιμων λειτουργιών των δύο CRM, δεσμευτική προσφορά, αλλαγή αμοιβών ή νέα πολιτική πιστοποίησης. Για πραγματική εργασία ισχύουν οι εγκεκριμένοι εταιρικοί όροι και οι αρμοδιότητες. Το μάθημα 60 είναι προετοιμασία, όχι δεύτερη επίσημη τελική εξέταση."]],["Το αντικείμενο του κεφαλαίου",["ΤΕΛΙΚΗ ΠΙΣΤΟΠΟΙΗΣΗ ΚΑΙ ΕΞΕΤΑΣΗ ENTERPRISE SALES Πώς αποφασίζουμε ποιος πωλητής είναι πραγματικά έτοιμος να εκπροσωπήσει τη DISTILLOGIC απέναντι σε μεγάλες εταιρείες"]],["Σημεία 1–25 · Ο ΣΤΟΧΟΣ",[{"heading":"1. Ο ΣΤΟΧΟΣ","paragraphs":["Μετά από 59 μαθήματα: δεν αρκεί: ο salesperson: να έχει: διαβάσει."]},{"heading":"2. Πρέπει:","paragraphs":["να αποδείξει: ότι μπορεί: ΝΑ ΣΚΕΦΤΕΤΑΙ ΚΑΙ ΝΑ ΕΝΕΡΓΕΙ ΣΩΣΤΑ ΣΕ ΠΡΑΓΜΑΤΙΚΗ ENTERPRISE ΠΩΛΗΣΗ."]},{"heading":"3. Η ΤΕΛΙΚΗ ΕΞΕΤΑΣΗ","paragraphs":["δεν είναι: test απομνημόνευσης."]},{"heading":"4. Δεν μας ενδιαφέρει:","paragraphs":["αν θυμάται: 50 definitions."]},{"heading":"5. Μας ενδιαφέρει:","paragraphs":["αν μπορεί: να πάρει: μία πραγματική εταιρεία και να κινηθεί: σωστά."]},{"heading":"6. FINAL CERTIFICATION","paragraphs":["ελέγχει: Research Account Selection Stakeholder Mapping Outreach Cold Calling Discovery Qualification Business Case Technical Judgment Proposal Pricing Negotiation Objections CRM Governance Ethics."]},{"heading":"7. Η ΠΙΣΤΟΠΟΙΗΣΗ","paragraphs":["θα έχει: 6 ΜΕΡΗ."]},{"heading":"8. PART 1","paragraphs":["ACCOUNT RESEARCH & STRATEGY"]},{"heading":"9. PART 2","paragraphs":["OUTREACH & COLD CALL"]},{"heading":"10. PART 3","paragraphs":["DISCOVERY MEETING"]},{"heading":"11. PART 4","paragraphs":["QUALIFICATION & SOLUTION STRATEGY"]},{"heading":"12. PART 5","paragraphs":["PROPOSAL / NEGOTIATION / OBJECTIONS"]},{"heading":"13. PART 6","paragraphs":["CRM / GOVERNANCE / FINAL DECISION."]},{"heading":"14. TOTAL SCORE","paragraphs":["100 POINTS."]},{"heading":"15. PASS","paragraphs":["Recommended: 80/100."]},{"heading":"16. But:","paragraphs":["there are: automatic-fail behaviors."]},{"heading":"17. Meaning:","paragraphs":["someone may score: 85 and still: fail: if they: do something: dangerous."]},{"heading":"18. AUTOMATIC FAIL #1","paragraphs":["INVENTS CUSTOMER FACTS."]},{"heading":"19. Example:","paragraphs":["Company announces new warehouse. Seller says: «They have inventory accuracy problem.»"]},{"heading":"20. Wrong.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"21. Correct:","paragraphs":["«The expansion may create inventory or process complexity. We need to validate whether that exists.»"]},{"heading":"22. AUTOMATIC FAIL #2","paragraphs":["INVENTS DISTILLOGIC CAPABILITIES."]},{"heading":"23. Example:","paragraphs":["«Yes, we have already built exactly that system for five banks.» when: not true."]},{"heading":"24. Automatic fail.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"25. AUTOMATIC FAIL #3","paragraphs":["PROMISES TECHNICAL DELIVERY WITHOUT VALIDATION."]}]],["Σημεία 26–50 · Example:",[{"heading":"26. Example:","paragraphs":["«Yes, we can integrate everything in 2 weeks.»"]},{"heading":"27. Fail.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"28. AUTOMATIC FAIL #4","paragraphs":["FABRICATES ROI."]},{"heading":"29. Example:","paragraphs":["«This will save you 40%.»"]},{"heading":"30. No customer baseline.","paragraphs":["Fail."]},{"heading":"31. AUTOMATIC FAIL #5","paragraphs":["AGREES TO UNAPPROVED COMMERCIAL TERMS."]},{"heading":"32. Example:","paragraphs":["«Sure, 25% discount.»"]},{"heading":"33. Fail.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"34. AUTOMATIC FAIL #6","paragraphs":["LIES TO GATEKEEPER OR CUSTOMER."]},{"heading":"35. Example:","paragraphs":["«The CEO asked me to call.» when false."]},{"heading":"36. Fail.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"37. AUTOMATIC FAIL #7","paragraphs":["IGNORES SECURITY / LEGAL / SAFETY RISK."]},{"heading":"38. Example:","paragraphs":["Bank customer: «Let's bypass security approval.» Salesperson: «Fine.»"]},{"heading":"39. Fail.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"40. AUTOMATIC FAIL #8","paragraphs":["SELLS SOMETHING THEY KNOW DELIVERY CANNOT SUPPORT."]},{"heading":"41. Fail.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"42. AUTOMATIC FAIL #9","paragraphs":["PRESSURES CUSTOMER WITH FAKE URGENCY."]},{"heading":"43. Example:","paragraphs":["«Price expires tonight.» when: not true."]},{"heading":"44. Fail.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"45. AUTOMATIC FAIL #10","paragraphs":["SHOWS DISHONEST BEHAVIOR."]},{"heading":"46. Enterprise trust:","paragraphs":["non-negotiable."]},{"heading":"47. PART 1","paragraphs":["ACCOUNT RESEARCH & STRATEGY 15 POINTS"]},{"heading":"48. Candidate receives:","paragraphs":["one company."]},{"heading":"49. They get:","paragraphs":["30 minutes."]},{"heading":"50. Need produce:","paragraphs":["Account Brief Trigger Stakeholders Hypothesis Risks First approach."]}]],["Σημεία 51–75 · EXAMPLE CASE",[{"heading":"51. EXAMPLE CASE","paragraphs":["Company: large logistics group."]},{"heading":"52. Information given:","paragraphs":["Expanding warehouse network Hiring integration engineers New client portal announced Operations in 4 countries."]},{"heading":"53. Candidate must NOT say:","paragraphs":["«They definitely need a new WMS.»"]},{"heading":"54. Candidate should say:","paragraphs":["«Warehouse and geographic expansion may increase complexity around order flow, client visibility, integrations and reporting.»"]},{"heading":"55. SCORING — RESEARCH","paragraphs":["Relevant facts: __/3"]},{"heading":"56. Trigger quality:","paragraphs":["__/3"]},{"heading":"57. Stakeholder selection:","paragraphs":["__/3"]},{"heading":"58. Hypothesis quality:","paragraphs":["__/3"]},{"heading":"59. No unsupported assumptions:","paragraphs":["__/3"]},{"heading":"60. TOTAL","paragraphs":["__/15."]},{"heading":"61. STRONG ANSWER","paragraphs":["shows: difference: between: FACT and HYPOTHESIS."]},{"heading":"62. EXAM QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Why this company?»"]},{"heading":"63. Candidate must explain:","paragraphs":["specific fit."]},{"heading":"64. EXAM QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Why now?»"]},{"heading":"65. Candidate identifies:","paragraphs":["trigger."]},{"heading":"66. EXAM QUESTION","paragraphs":["«Why this person?»"]},{"heading":"67. Candidate maps:","paragraphs":["stakeholder to problem."]},{"heading":"68. EXAM QUESTION","paragraphs":["«What do you still not know?»"]},{"heading":"69. Excellent candidate:","paragraphs":["has: clear unknowns."]},{"heading":"70. Weak candidate:","paragraphs":["pretends: to know everything."]},{"heading":"71. PART 2","paragraphs":["OUTREACH & COLD CALL 15 POINTS"]},{"heading":"72. Candidate receives:","paragraphs":["target role. Example: COO."]},{"heading":"73. Must create:","paragraphs":["Email LinkedIn approach 60-second cold-call opening."]},{"heading":"74. COLD CALL ROLEPLAY","paragraphs":["Examiner: plays customer."]},{"heading":"75. Customer:","paragraphs":["busy."]}]],["Σημεία 76–100 · Candidate must:",[{"heading":"76. Candidate must:","paragraphs":["open quickly."]},{"heading":"77. Good structure:","paragraphs":["Name ↓ Reason ↓ Trigger ↓ Hypothesis ↓ Question."]},{"heading":"78. Example:","paragraphs":["«Καλημέρα κύριε Δημητρίου, Γιώργος από DISTILLOGIC Technologies. Ξέρω ότι σας καλώ χωρίς να έχουμε μιλήσει ξανά. Να σας πω σε 20 δευτερόλεπτα γιατί σας πήρα; Είδα ότι επεκτείνετε το warehouse network σας σε νέες αγορές. Σε τέτοιες φάσεις συχνά αυξάνεται η πολυπλοκότητα σε order visibility και system handoffs. Δεν γνωρίζω αν ισχύει σε εσάς. Ποιο operational process δυσκολεύεται περισσότερο καθώς μεγαλώνει το δίκτυο;»"]},{"heading":"79. Good.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"80. BAD","paragraphs":["«Είμαστε κορυφαία εταιρεία software...»"]},{"heading":"81. Deduction.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"82. EMAIL TEST","paragraphs":["Must be: short."]},{"heading":"83. No:","paragraphs":["generic catalog."]},{"heading":"84. Scoring:","paragraphs":["Relevance: __/3"]},{"heading":"85. Trigger:","paragraphs":["__/3"]},{"heading":"86. Hypothesis:","paragraphs":["__/3"]},{"heading":"87. Question:","paragraphs":["__/3"]},{"heading":"88. Professional tone:","paragraphs":["__/3"]},{"heading":"89. TOTAL","paragraphs":["__/15."]},{"heading":"90. EXAMINER OBJECTION","paragraphs":["«Δεν ενδιαφέρομαι.»"]},{"heading":"91. Candidate:","paragraphs":["must not: argue."]},{"heading":"92. Good:","paragraphs":["«Κατανοητό. Είναι επειδή δεν αποτελεί priority ή επειδή το έχετε ήδη καλύψει;»"]},{"heading":"93. If customer says:","paragraphs":["«Το έχουμε καλύψει.»"]},{"heading":"94. Candidate:","paragraphs":["should exit: professionally."]},{"heading":"95. This can score:","paragraphs":["very highly."]},{"heading":"96. Because:","paragraphs":["good selling: includes: good exit."]},{"heading":"97. PART 3","paragraphs":["DISCOVERY MEETING 25 POINTS"]},{"heading":"98. This is:","paragraphs":["the most important: part."]},{"heading":"99. Candidate gets:","paragraphs":["20–25-minute roleplay."]},{"heading":"100. Examiner:","paragraphs":["plays: customer."]}]],["Σημεία 101–125 · Customer initially says:",[{"heading":"101. Customer initially says:","paragraphs":["«We want a dashboard.»"]},{"heading":"102. Candidate:","paragraphs":["must not: sell dashboard."]},{"heading":"103. Ask:","paragraphs":["«What decision are you trying to improve with the dashboard?»"]},{"heading":"104. Customer:","paragraphs":["«We want to see profitability faster.»"]},{"heading":"105. Candidate:","paragraphs":["continues."]},{"heading":"106. Customer:","paragraphs":["«Reports take 10 days.»"]},{"heading":"107. Candidate:","paragraphs":["asks: why."]},{"heading":"108. Customer:","paragraphs":["«Data comes from 8 subsidiaries.»"]},{"heading":"109. Candidate:","paragraphs":["asks: where manual work exists."]},{"heading":"110. Customer:","paragraphs":["«Customer names don't match.»"]},{"heading":"111. Root problem:","paragraphs":["not: dashboard."]},{"heading":"112. Root:","paragraphs":["data/master-data reconciliation."]},{"heading":"113. Strong candidate:","paragraphs":["finds this."]},{"heading":"114. Discovery scoring:","paragraphs":["Opening/agenda: __/3"]},{"heading":"115. Current-state understanding:","paragraphs":["__/4"]},{"heading":"116. Root-cause discovery:","paragraphs":["__/5"]},{"heading":"117. Impact/quantification:","paragraphs":["__/4"]},{"heading":"118. Stakeholders:","paragraphs":["__/3"]},{"heading":"119. Why now:","paragraphs":["__/2"]},{"heading":"120. Listening/follow-up:","paragraphs":["__/2"]},{"heading":"121. Next step:","paragraphs":["__/2"]},{"heading":"122. TOTAL","paragraphs":["__/25."]},{"heading":"123. HIGH SCORE","paragraphs":["requires: customer speaking: more than seller."]},{"heading":"124. Candidate should:","paragraphs":["summarize."]},{"heading":"125. Example:","paragraphs":["«If I understood correctly, the immediate issue isn't dashboard design. The reporting team spends significant time reconciling customer and financial data from eight subsidiaries, which delays profitability reporting by around ten days. With the new acquisition, that workload is expected to increase. Is that accurate?»"]}]],["Σημεία 126–150 · Excellent.",[{"heading":"126. Excellent.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"127. Then:","paragraphs":["next step: could be: data/process workshop."]},{"heading":"128. Not:","paragraphs":["proposal."]},{"heading":"129. Candidate must choose:","paragraphs":["correct next action."]},{"heading":"130. EXAMINER MAY TRY TO TRAP","paragraphs":["Candidate."]},{"heading":"131. Example:","paragraphs":["«Can you give me price now?»"]},{"heading":"132. Candidate should:","paragraphs":["not evade: but explain: unknown scope."]},{"heading":"133. Good:","paragraphs":["«I can give you a meaningful range after we validate the data sources, number of systems and reconciliation scope. A final number now would be guesswork.»"]},{"heading":"134. Excellent.","paragraphs":[]},{"heading":"135. Another trap:","paragraphs":["«Can you guarantee 6 weeks?»"]},{"heading":"136. Candidate:","paragraphs":["must escalate: delivery validation."]},{"heading":"137. PART 4","paragraphs":["QUALIFICATION & SOLUTION STRATEGY 15 POINTS"]},{"heading":"138. After discovery:","paragraphs":["candidate receives: 10 minutes."]},{"heading":"139. Must produce:","paragraphs":["Problem Statement MEDDPICC view Opportunity score Main risks Recommended next step."]},{"heading":"140. PROBLEM STATEMENT","paragraphs":["Should include: Process Pain Impact Trigger."]},{"heading":"141. Bad:","paragraphs":["«Customer needs data solution.»"]},{"heading":"